olved\":true,\"title\":\"B.D. -new link below\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eNEW PREVIEW LINK : \u003ca href=\\\"https://bureau-dimanche.framer.website/#home\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003ehttps://bureau-dimanche.framer.website/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBureau Dimanche is an independent branding studio. Their old website didn\u0026#39;t reflect the quality of their craft. We\u0026#39;ve worked together to build them a solid and coherent platform to show their work and attract solid clients.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"NEW PREVIEW LINK : \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"https://bureau-dimanche.framer.website/\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"https://bureau-dimanche.framer.website/#home\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Bureau Dimanche is an independent branding studio. Their old website didn't reflect the quality of their craft. We've worked together to build them a solid and coherent platform to show their work and attract solid clients.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Bureau Dimanche is an independent branding studio. Their old website didn't reflect the quality of their craft. We've worked together to build them a solid and coherent platform to show their work and attract solid clients.\",\"slug\":\"b-d-new-link-below\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"c7402719-b2d2-4789-8218-ea705ead84d8\",\"name\":\"Armand Luxey\",\"slug\":\"armand-luxey\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/c7402719-b2d2-4789-8218-ea705ead84d8/ni9j7vi9\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/snA00N81Nk7H001Vg0202JlkXchT00R6RZN1WRJk4L1JHmw00.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/snA00N81Nk7H001Vg0202JlkXchT00R6RZN1WRJk4L1JHmw00/thumbnail.webp?time=2.733\",\"aspectRatio\":\"767:540\",\"duration\":6.602333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019d781f-7288-79ab-b5f1-d9e96ca4eddc\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":225,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":6},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-10T16:00:20.099Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-28T20:31:41.830Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-04-10T16:00:20.104Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://bureaudimanche.com/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"4e292c6b-a094-4031-be7b-7affa4349187\",\"name\":\"Agency\",\"slug\":\"agency\"},{\"id\":\"6a730e3d-bdf2-42a2-ab42-eee5ef39b694\",\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"},{\"id\":\"ddd39099-5b17-42e0-b333-7b7c480a114f\",\"name\":\"Business\",\"slug\":\"business\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16911\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Honeymoon Agency\",\"body\":\"\u003ch3\u003eOverview\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eA modern Framer website for a premium honeymoon travel agency in Hannover, designed to create a more emotional, trustworthy and high quality digital presence.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eChallenge\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe existing website needed a stronger visual identity, clearer content structure and a more consistent experience across desktop, tablet and mobile.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eSolution\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eWe refined the overall design, improved the user experience, optimized layouts for all devices and created a cleaner structure that makes the travel offers easier to explore.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eResult\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eA polished and responsive Framer website that better reflects the premium positioning of Hochzeitsreisen Hannover and provides couples with an inspiring experience while planning their honeymoon.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Overview\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"A modern Framer website for a premium honeymoon travel agency in Hannover, designed to create a more emotional, trustworthy and high quality digital presence.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Challenge\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The existing website needed a stronger visual identity, clearer content structure and a more consistent experience across desktop, tablet and mobile.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Solution\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"We refined the overall design, improved the user experience, optimized layouts for all devices and created a cleaner structure that makes the travel offers easier to explore.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Result\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"A polished and responsive Framer website that better reflects the premium positioning of Hochzeitsreisen Hannover and provides couples with an inspiring experience while planning their honeymoon.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"honeymoon-agency\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"92c2a437-4e58-4cd2-9a23-5fd81786f849\",\"name\":\"Webnity X\",\"slug\":\"webnity-x\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/92c2a437-4e58-4cd2-9a23-5fd81786f849/bcts2r71\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/92c2a437-4e58-4cd2-9a23-5fd81786f849/019ff022-b38f-7792-8fbb-5edc27eeb57e.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(30 13% 24%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.5}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019ff023-3e41-71c5-810b-87257ee8d9bc\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"A modern Framer website for a premium honeymoon travel agency in Hannover., Germany \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The project focused on refining the visual design, improving the user experience across all devices, optimizing the site structure and creating a more polished, trustworthy digital presence for couples planning their honeymoon.\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":43,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":5},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-11T09:24:28.787Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-11T09:24:28.787Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-11T09:24:28.779Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://www.hochzeitsreisen-hannover.de/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"ddd39099-5b17-42e0-b333-7b7c480a114f\",\"name\":\"Business\",\"slug\":\"business\"},{\"id\":\"4256b748-1be0-4162-aa02-cb9346d9f63f\",\"name\":\"Travel\",\"slug\":\"travel\"},{\"id\":\"4e292c6b-a094-4031-be7b-7affa4349187\",\"name\":\"Agency\",\"slug\":\"agency\"}]}},{\"id\":\"8084\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"bychudy\",\"body\":null,\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"A portfolio website made for my friend, inspired by Mac UI and his messy dektop\",\"slug\":\"bychudy\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"95797e9f-c191-4863-ab8a-97fc15266902\",\"name\":\"Asia Gawron\",\"slug\":\"asia-gawron\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/622046/avatar-NJXUgPMi7incgZzZJ0TXKLBSnjbaEB.jpg\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/sH61dVKejVa7i36NX026NYIFe8bDLxo42GpV3G2WYorg.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/sH61dVKejVa7i36NX026NYIFe8bDLxo42GpV3G2WYorg/thumbnail.webp?time=19.991\",\"aspectRatio\"