anand pandey\",\"slug\":\"shivanand-pandey\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/2fa80a30-6490-4372-8362-222d24fa42e6/ma203sai\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/2fa80a30-6490-4372-8362-222d24fa42e6/01a001a8-6d18-730b-a3d5-176141d49f32.webp\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(30 90% 36%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/2fa80a30-6490-4372-8362-222d24fa42e6/01a00169-1446-7009-a24c-0ffa15408d73.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 58%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"01a0016b-a9c0-7518-ae1a-17380e706737\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"I’ve recently launched \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"CrazyUI 2.0\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"A design library packed with UI components, Figma resources, Framer components \u0026 templates - built for designers who want to move faster.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Would love to hear what you think \"},{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"eyes\",\"emoji\":\"👀\"}}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"→ \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"crazyui.com\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"http://crazyui.com\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":29,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":6},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-14T17:57:07.475Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-14T19:04:36.051Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-14T17:57:07.466Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://crazyui.com/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"1fec15c2-ca4a-4d52-bf3a-c04e6d002202\",\"name\":\"SaaS\",\"slug\":\"saas\"},{\"id\":\"6a730e3d-bdf2-42a2-ab42-eee5ef39b694\",\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"}]}},{\"id\":\"14371\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"RabenRifaie\",\"body\":\"\u003ch2\u003eRabenRifaie portfolio redesign. \u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eAn immersive portfolio, featuring high-quality 3D animations, tactile textures, and a seamless responsive layout for every device. A collaborative project with \u003ca class=\\\"mention\\\" data-type=\\\"mention\\\" data-id=\\\"3ef6f63c-419d-47bb-b96e-ae1abb169400\\\" href=\\\"/community/creator/@rabenrifaie/\\\"\u003e@RabenRifaie\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"RabenRifaie portfolio redesign. \"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"An immersive portfolio, featuring high-quality 3D animations, tactile textures, and a seamless responsive layout for every device. A collaborative project with \"},{\"type\":\"mention\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"3ef6f63c-419d-47bb-b96e-ae1abb169400\",\"slug\":\"rabenrifaie\",\"label\":\"RabenRifaie\",\"mentionSuggestionChar\":\"@\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\".\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"A creative design studio for branding, immersive web and 3D motion.\",\"slug\":\"rabenrifaie\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"8134d96e-6a7e-49d6-bdff-49a6b26ce6f1\",\"name\":\"Oliwia Mikołajczak\",\"slug\":\"oliwia-mikolajczak\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/420111/avatar-Sv2u6ydIeWo9sGGOpaqa2c7PnR3Sst.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/Lg6ZDn9gHG01jUmIA2ojS9DNV00rtyIBwSwFDaHjyk9i8.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/Lg6ZDn9gHG01jUmIA2ojS9DNV00rtyIBwSwFDaHjyk9i8/thumbnail.webp?time=6.661\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4:3\",\"duration\":29.2}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/sites/14371/thumbnail-Eq5GuC025SCf2seq9r1jlQiTqTF3Dq.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(75 80% 16%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019d4957-40ec-7d9f-9d62-6460b138f82f\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":173,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":7},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-01T13:59:08.267Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-15T10:15:41.207Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-04-01T13:59:08.268Z\",\"featuredAt\":\"2026-06-16T10:19:28.198Z\",\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://www.rabenrifaie.com/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"6a730e3d-bdf2-42a2-ab42-eee5ef39b694\",\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"},{\"id\":\"4e292c6b-a094-4031-be7b-7affa4349187\",\"name\":\"Agency\",\"slug\":\"agency\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16659\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"ZapConnect 2026\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eZapConnect is an annual AI conference run by Zapier. I had the pleasure to work with them again in the 2026 ZC registration pages. Design was handled by the Zapier team, the build was done by me. \u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"ZapConnect is an annual AI conference run by Zapier. I had the pleasure to work with them again in the 2026 ZC registration pages. Design was handled by the Zapier team, the build was done by me. \"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"zapconnect-2026\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"f609bf1b-a93b-49be-9d70-43169680e4a8\",\"name\":\"Adriano Reis\",\"slug\":\"adrianoreis\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/38026/0be83efc57823132d40c7c5c96ffa3c2-0CBrG7AlRLKWwwnPaQKyhD7alN89ik\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/Jflqn5Hyfv9qlV6cAS9sJoolooG2sGZseiLmkkItv8g.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/Jflqn5Hyfv9qlV6cAS9sJoolooG2sGZseiLmkkItv8g/thumbnail.webp?time=20.183\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4:3\",\"duration\":43.853333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019f5b87-8c72-7303-82f6-44f6384d7f3a\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Recent work for Zapier\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":104,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":9},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-13T12:50:37.455Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-13T12:56:15.067Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-13T12:50:37.451Z\",\"featuredAt\":\"2026-07-13T13:07:51.108Z\",\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://www.zapier.com/zapconnect/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"0539c25a-136d-4f8b-a2e7-342a21b7d607\",\"name\":\"AI\",\"slug\":\"ai\"},{\"id\":\"1fec15c2-ca4a-4d52-bf3a-c04e6d002202\",\"name\":\"SaaS\",\"slug\":\"saas\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16788\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Teona Kokhodze\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003ePortfolio for Teona Kokhodze, creative director working across design, art, architecture and visual culture from Tbilisi. The site is a single continuous surface: an infinite gallery where projects open in place and close back into the stream, with no pages and almost no interface. Her name performs the entrance, rising into place as the gallery composes itself behind it. Built in Framer on a fully custom engine, with inertial scroll, seamless transitions and a CMS she edits herself.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Portfolio for Teona Kokhodze, creative director working across design, art, architecture and visual culture from Tbilisi. The site is a single continuous surface: an infinite gallery where projects open in place and close back into the stream, with no pages and almost no interface. Her name performs the entrance, rising into place as the gallery composes itself behind it. Built in Framer on a fully custom engine, with inertial scroll, seamless transitions and a CMS she edits herself.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"teona-kokhodze\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"668cbe8e-5753-41e9-aaf5-2dbca81b2784\",\"name\":\"Vítrea Studio\",\"slug\":\"vitrea-studio\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/1183737/Edm2RTpm1-ZgMBdL0cpYmCxg2YE1nMO5xG80rTWo\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/NHoSi01DwQhYrsV02dQibUAxnFowup300j38FwYWvS4eFo.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/NHoSi01DwQhYrsV02dQibUAxnFowup300j38FwYWvS4eFo/thumbnail.webp?time=15.34\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4:3\",\"duration\":22.25}},{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/IS3h3MwiI02M8BUxsLZaj25pZzKVe016gTj6ny7uK6WqQ.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/IS3h3MwiI02M8BUxsLZaj25pZzKVe016gTj6ny7uK6WqQ/thumbnail.webp?time=2.9\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4:3\",\"duration\":8.514556}},{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/dyMWg6JYbMfFABB762Ww8W01a00nDwWStuC00vwgv7GbEQ.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/dyMWg6JYbMfFABB762Ww8W01a00nDwWStuC00vwgv7GbEQ/thumbnail.webp?time=2\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4:3\",\"duration\":9.981222}},{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/GSxa9zzNMMTTmQ80200G2700Y900PqlY02ibjRR9Ed1lm18I.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/GSxa9zzNMMTTmQ80200G2700Y900PqlY02ibjRR9Ed1lm18I/thumbnail.webp?time=1.567\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4:3\",\"duration\":15.642667}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/668cbe8e-5753-41e9-aaf5-2dbca81b2784/019fa2ff-8427-75cd-805e-b80df1580aa6.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 58%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019fa303-66fa-753a-bc70-ace610ae25f3\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"just launched Teona Kokhodze's new portfolio\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"one continuous surface. infinite scroll.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"built in \"},{\"type\":\"mention\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"a7cd9fe6-cf81-4a41-8e93-bca0291dba80\",\"slug\":\"framer\",\"label\":\"Framer\",\"mentionSuggestionChar\":\"@\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" with Framer Agents\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":35,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":6},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-27T09:58:56.543Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-23T12:56:04.438Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-27T09:58:56.534Z\",\"featuredAt\":\"2026-07-28T07:52:35.499Z\",\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://teonak.com/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"6a730e3d-bdf2-42a2-ab42-eee5ef39b694\",\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"},{\"id\":\"cb1ce5d0-8749-428e-b0d8-917786928ffd\",\"name\":\"Personal\",\"slug\":\"personal\"},{\"id\":\"b65821c4-e205-4861-a28b-1623536037f7\",\"name\":\"Landing Page\",\"slug\":\"landing-page\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16964\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Metasense\",\"body\":\"$4f\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Metasense helps leading tech companies build for the future - AI automation, intelligent system integrations, and on-demand expert talent. The brief was to make an agency site that feels as advanced as the work it sells, so the design leans into a dark, editorial-cinematic direction: heavy type, restrained color, and motion that reveals rather than decorates. The underlying theme is heavily inspired by tech-renaissance - signifying the technological leap over the last few years.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Key moments include a hero section that captures the essence of the company at a single glance, an interactive \\\"Intelligence Layer\\\" module explorer modeled on a workspace UI - that is fully functional, a module based case studies section, hover-to-flip testimonials, and a pricing configurator where visitors assemble add-ons and watch the estimate update in real time. \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"But it doesn't end there. Every page is built with diligent details making the entire web experience unique.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Built and shipped entirely in Framer.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"metasense\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"ac926a11-ccfb-49c1-88b5-9a7f851325bf\",\"name\":\"Zarak Shiraz\",\"slug\":\"thebigdesignproject\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/679929/avatar-6PnQ9MZvU6661zQQUU3FlD7jFsneav.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/ac926a11-ccfb-49c1-88b5-9a7f851325bf/01a015b0-7187-71a9-928d-69b41507e93a.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/ac926a11-ccfb-49c1-88b5-9a7f851325bf/01a015b9-beac-74db-a543-03ad136754a8.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/ac926a11-ccfb-49c1-88b5-9a7f851325bf/01a015b9-d94a-7461-bdf1-aca0db2da0fd.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/ac926a11-ccfb-49c1-88b5-9a7f851325bf/01a015b9-f2fc-719c-82cb-8fe2c3eb229f.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/ac926a11-ccfb-49c1-88b5-9a7f851325bf/01a015ba-065f-710b-833f-bbed8c9b9c85.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"01a015bc-5e0a-733a-abaa-bfe608e46779\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Excited to finally share this!\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"A lot of hard work went into building this experience. Our own take on tech-renaissance. \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Every page is crafted with meticulous detail. \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Couldnt be happier with the output. \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"It's a fun scroll!\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":16,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":3},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-18T16:37:40.917Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-18T16:37:40.917Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-18T16:37:40.910Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://www.metasense.dev/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"0539c25a-136d-4f8b-a2e7-342a21b7d607\",\"name\":\"AI\",\"slug\":\"ai\"},{\"id\":\"1fec15c2-ca4a-4d52-bf3a-c04e6d002202\",\"name\":\"SaaS\",\"slug\":\"saas\"},{\"id\":\"4e292c6b-a094-4031-be7b-7affa4349187\",\"name\":\"Agency\",\"slug\":\"agency\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16791\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Framer Shortcuts\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMove faster with keyboard shortcuts\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp