igner and certified UX designer, I leverage Framer’s website building platform as an official Pro Expert and Partner, delivering on time and with minimal friction.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Based in Cape Town with over a decade of trusted experience as a visual designer and certified UX designer, I leverage Framer’s website building platform as an official Pro Expert and Partner, delivering on time and with minimal friction.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"robin-louw\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"4b25ccdc-a5e0-4822-b362-756e4f7aab9e\",\"name\":\"Robin Louw\",\"slug\":\"robin-louw\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/4b25ccdc-a5e0-4822-b362-756e4f7aab9e/em3bsj95\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/4b25ccdc-a5e0-4822-b362-756e4f7aab9e/01a01ab8-a7f9-75af-9537-d79037ecc582.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"01a01ab9-388d-70b4-9b95-565f247b8a19\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Updating my personal site (WIP)\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":8,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":3},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-19T15:52:20.870Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-19T15:52:20.870Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-19T15:52:20.865Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://roblouw.com/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"6a730e3d-bdf2-42a2-ab42-eee5ef39b694\",\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"},{\"id\":\"cb1ce5d0-8749-428e-b0d8-917786928ffd\",\"name\":\"Personal\",\"slug\":\"personal\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16782\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\