:\"Business\",\"slug\":\"business\"},{\"id\":\"1fec15c2-ca4a-4d52-bf3a-c04e6d002202\",\"name\":\"SaaS\",\"slug\":\"saas\"},{\"id\":\"4e292c6b-a094-4031-be7b-7affa4349187\",\"name\":\"Agency\",\"slug\":\"agency\"}]}},{\"id\":\"15792\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Paul Hahn\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eModern personal portfolio for a Web and UI/UX designer.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Modern personal portfolio for a Web and UI/UX designer.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Website design for my personal portfolio, focused on a modern and minimalist user interface. The goal was to create a clean digital presence that highlights my work, communicates my design approach, and offers a smooth, intuitive browsing experience.\\r\\n\",\"slug\":\"paul-hahn\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"1458ed1d-0103-46fa-80a1-a6aa2b74269b\",\"name\":\"Paul Hahn\",\"slug\":\"paul-hahn-design\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/273051/avatar-hzXVPOU0PIM3Vetim8fCKB1vCwIa2M.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/1458ed1d-0103-46fa-80a1-a6aa2b74269b/0sam5ko4\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019e568a-5d52-77dd-bc39-7b5642d24272\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":157,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":5},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-05-23T20:32:49.007Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-06-30T08:41:47.028Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-05-23T20:32:48.978Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://paul-hahn.com/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"6a730e3d-bdf2-42a2-ab42-eee5ef39b694\",\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"},{\"id\":\"cb1ce5d0-8749-428e-b0d8-917786928ffd\",\"name\":\"Personal\",\"slug\":\"personal\"},{\"id\":\"ddd39099-5b17-42e0-b333-7b7c480a114f\",\"name\":\"Business\",\"slug\":\"business\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16726\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Luxury Clone\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eLuxury Clone Australia is a responsive product catalogue website for premium luxury-inspired watches, bags, shoes, clothing, and accessories. Users can browse products by category or brand and check their availability. The website uses WhatsApp and email for product enquiries and order placement. It offers a modern design with easy navigation and delivery information.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Luxury Clone Australia is a responsive product catalogue website for premium luxury-inspired watches, bags, shoes, clothing, and accessories. Users can browse products by category or brand and check their availability. The website uses WhatsApp and email for product enquiries and order placement. It offers a modern design with easy navigation and delivery information.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"luxury-clone\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"e384faea-043f-4f5c-bd25-070ec91488d7\",\"name\":\"Framer Geeks\",\"slug\":\"framergeeks\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/65683/avatar-DpmNXlAfqaNbZuhHKKWXXcPtwRkgYh.jpg\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/XBJ01NxgaKQZwQDggCnSLFARvAh3Tq2QIVsH3SqAJzN8.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/XBJ01NxgaKQZwQDggCnSLFARvAh3Tq2QIVsH3SqAJzN8/thumbnail.webp?time=1.267\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4:3\",\"duration\":8.576}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019f8340-0354-75b1-b82c-b19ba290525e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":33,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":8},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-21T05:57:16.039Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-21T06:11:19.629Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-21T05:57:16.033Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://luxurycloneaustralia.com/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"3b2881c5-bbfb-430d-83f6-b1b0ac597b8d\",\"name\":\"Ecommerce\",\"slug\":\"ecommerce\"},{\"id\":\"ddd39099-5b17-42e0-b333-7b7c480a114f\",\"name\":\"Business\",\"slug\":\"business\"},{\"id\":\"b65821c4-e205-4861-a28b-1623536037f7\",\"name\":\"Landing Page\",\"slug\":\"landing-page\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16636\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Adam Jakubowski\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eMinimal portfolio for a photographer, focused on creative navigation and interactions.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Minimal portfolio for a photographer, focused on creative navigation and interactions.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"adam-jakubowski\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"95797e9f-c191-4863-ab8a-97fc15266902\",\"name\":\"Asia Gawron\",\"slug\":\"asia-gawron\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/622046/avatar-NJXUgPMi7incgZzZJ0TXKLBSnjbaEB.jpg\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/guFi5hdIdp2d00gF4ii1Qo5g13iHRnxrwdj5T3WzFr48.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/guFi5hdIdp2d00gF4ii1Qo5g13iHRnxrwdj5T3WzFr48/thumbnail.webp?time=8.15\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4:3\",\"duration\":21.066667}},{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/E8DDzrpU8Lm6j2vGOwSUlyZSgCSsJenKkkeos58UgnA.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/E8DDzrpU8Lm6j2vGOwSUlyZSgCSsJenKkkeos58UgnA/thumbnail.webp?time=4.883\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4:3\",\"duration\":20.6}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019f4bd4-807c-775f-85b4-c1089dbcbda7\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":86,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":5},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-10T11:40:45.265Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-10T11:40:45.265Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-10T11:40:45.260Z\",\"featuredAt\":\"2026-07-10T12:03:46.012Z\",\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://adamjakubowski.pl/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"6a730e3d-bdf2-42a2-ab42-eee5ef39b694\",\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"},{\"id\":\"ddd39099-5b17-42e0-b333-7b7c480a114f\",\"name\":\"Business\",\"slug\":\"business\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16369\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Jijo's Space\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eJijo built this site as a space in the great wide open: a turquoise sea, open grassland, clouds moving overhead at their own pace. Nature isn\u0026#39;t a backdrop here, it\u0026#39;s the whole setting.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEvery object carries its own character: the pegboard, the lamp, the old Mac still humming in the corner, the tear-off contact card. Nothing is decoration, everything has a reason to be there.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIt\u0026#39;s also his first time pulling different media into one place: 3D, illustration, motion, code, all working together instead of staying in separate lanes. The result feels less like a portfolio and more like a room he actually lives in, one he\u0026#39;s inviting you into.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Jijo built this site as a space in the great wide open: a turquoise sea, open grassland, clouds moving overhead at their own pace. Nature isn't a backdrop here, it's the whole setting.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Every object carries its own character: the pegboard, the lamp, the old Mac still humming in the corner, the tear-off contact card. Nothing is decoration, everything has a reason to be there.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"It's also his first time pulling different media into one place: 3D, illustration, motion, code, all working together instead of staying in separate lanes. The result feels less like a portfolio and more like a room he actually lives in, one he's inviting you into.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"jijo-s-space\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"2ba2511b-b125-4567-8f14-3486ed9f66d7\",\"name\":\"Jijo M\",\"slug\":\"ji-jo\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/2ba2511b-b125-4567-8f14-3486ed9f66d7/uilx4a0c\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/2ba2511b-b125-4567-8f14-3486ed9f66d7/01a0382e-a1c5-76d7-b1f6-20eacb362ab0.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(84 36% 28%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.497659906396256}},{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/OsHsNHRk2pg9REz1J1dzzzqVf43Ny5kWJVIvxuTGVOQ.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/OsHsNHRk2pg9REz1J1dzzzqVf43Ny5kWJVIvxuTGVOQ/thumbnail.webp?time=15.023\",\"aspectRatio\":\"8:5\",\"duration\":16.633333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019edae5-dd3c-712b-a04f-c16b682b37f1\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Built this to feel like a breath of fresh air, not another portfolio.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":127,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":5},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-06-18T13:22:37.980Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-25T09:09:54.248Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-06-18T13:22:37.973Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://jijo.fyi/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"6a730e3d-bdf2-42a2-ab42-eee5ef39b694\",\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"},{\"id\":\"cb1ce5d0-8749-428e-b0d8-917786928ffd\",\"name\":\"Personal\",\"slug\":\"personal\"},{\"id\":\"b65821c4-e205-4861-a28b-1623536037f7\",\"name\":\"Landing Page\",\"slug\":\"landing-page\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16889\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Nourhan Fawzy\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWonder Shapes Form. Form Creates Wonder.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eI\u0026#39;m a multidisciplinary designer working across brand identity, typography, packaging, objects, UI/UX, editorial, and illustration. I see design as the act of giving observation intention—transforming ideas into thoughtful experiences that invite curiosity and connection. Whether branding, physical objects, spatial interventions, or digital products, each project is driven by the same goal: creating meaningful work that people want to explore.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Wonder Shapes Form. Form Creates Wonder.\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"I'm a multidisciplinary designer working across brand identity, typography, packaging, objects, UI/UX, editorial, and illustration. I see design as the act of giving observation intention—transforming ideas into thoughtful experiences that invite curiosity and connection. Whether branding, physical objects, spatial interventions, or digital products, each project is driven by the same goal: creating meaningful work that people want to explore.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"nourhan-fawzy\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"c4454309-9a1f-4030-a9c2-5510d6ae43ff\",\"name\":\"Nourhan Fawzy\",\"slug\":\"nourhan-fawzy\",\"avatar\":null,\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/c4454309-9a1f-4030-a9c2-5510d6ae43ff/019fd6d8-2f6e-76f7-9418-ea5c9fe60268.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\