ogig_MH6Z4\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Thanks to everyone here for inspiring me with your work!\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":4,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":4},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-25T17:10:15.114Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-25T17:10:15.114Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-25T17:10:15.106Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://matthewencina.com/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"6a730e3d-bdf2-42a2-ab42-eee5ef39b694\",\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"},{\"id\":\"cb1ce5d0-8749-428e-b0d8-917786928ffd\",\"name\":\"Personal\",\"slug\":\"personal\"}]}},{\"id\":\"14532\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Fixa Planner\",\"body\":null,\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"ADHD-friendly planner landing page built in Framer. Features custom scroll animations, AI section with interactive cards, responsive design, and waitlist integration.\",\"slug\":\"fixa-planner\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"8a2d227e-90ad-4ec7-b7db-7b2c367ab2b8\",\"name\":\"Midu Studio\",\"slug\":\"midu-studio\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/740939/avatar-wVBmAKqb6QyUdRjuKuphhaxMuW05rl.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/sites/14532/thumbnail-1rry7PJl1E9W56ScO0hTPLGKvEHtFl.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(30 80% 16%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019d68f6-42fb-79f9-8532-460913b5b3de\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":219,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":4},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-07T17:21:02.713Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-07T17:21:02.713Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-04-07T17:21:02.715Z\",\"featuredAt\":\"2026-06