eators, entrepreneurs, and brands grow through high-performing social media content, professional video editing, and end-to-end content production. The goal was to create a visually immersive experience that instantly showcases the agency's creative expertise while driving visitors toward booking a consultation. I developed the website in Framer with a strong focus on storytelling, fluid interactions, and conversion-focused design.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Services Provided\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Framer Development\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Landing Page Development\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Custom Animations\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Video Integration\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Responsive Development\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Performance Optimization\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Let's Create a Website That Tells Your Story\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"WhatsApp:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"https://wa.me/923260558191?text=Hi%20Mazher!%20I%20just%20viewed%20your%20Pilea%20Agency%20project.%20I%E2%80%99m%20interested%20in%20creating%20a%20premium%20website%20for%20my%20business.%20Can%20we%20discuss%20my%20project%3F\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"l