s Art\",\"slug\":\"torylovesart\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/ec079f7a-68a9-4d4b-b29a-9fc363b0b88d/6e3f7m3c\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/oWPMD3tZHmhbbRu8aVSt01lJRTs7GiahfhgEb01BdqyUo.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/oWPMD3tZHmhbbRu8aVSt01lJRTs7GiahfhgEb01BdqyUo/thumbnail.webp?time=27.033\",\"aspectRatio\":\"521:360\",\"duration\":29.147889}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/sites/11272/thumbnail-l90JUUowZcdsRm1xABB9tusMfpR17p.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019b6bf5-c89f-7f36-8f12-d8dea674e378\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":142,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":5},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2025-12-29T21:13:48.446Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-09T10:26:15.046Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-12-29T21:13:48.447Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://toryloves.art/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"6a730e3d-bdf2-42a2-ab42-eee5ef39b694\",\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"},{\"id\":\"cb1ce5d0-8749-428e-b0d8-917786928ffd\",\"name\":\"Personal\",\"slug\":\"personal\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16944\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Atlas AI\",\"body\":\"$52\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Atlas AI — Revenue Engine Website\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Atlas is a premium SaaS website designed for an AI revenue platform built specifically for service businesses. The platform helps businesses automate their front office through AI-powered voice, messaging, lead follow-up, appointment booking, dead-lead reactivation, and customer engagement. The goal was to create a high-converting website that communicates the power of the product immediately while building trust through real-world results, testimonials, product showcases, and a strong performance-driven narrative.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"I \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"developed the website in Framer\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" with a strong focus on premium SaaS design, storytelling, smooth interactions, responsive layouts, and conversion-focused user experience.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Services Provided\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Framer Development\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"SaaS Website Development\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Landing Page Development\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Custom Animations \u0026 Interactions\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Responsive Development\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Video \u0026 Media Integration\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Conversion-Focused Design\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Performance Optimization\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Contact: \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"https://wa.me/923260558191?text=Hi%20Mazher!%20I%20just%20viewed%20your%20Atlas%20project.%20I%E2%80%99m%20interested%20in%20creating%20a%20premium%20website%20for%20my%20business.%20Can%20we%20discuss%20my%20project%3F\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"https://wa.me/923260558191?text=Hi%20Mazher!%20I%20just%20viewed%20your%20Atlas%20project.%20I%E2%80%99m%20interested%20in%20creating%20a%20premium%20website%20for%20my%20business.%20Can%20we%20discuss%20my%20project%3F\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"atlas-ai\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"34db2e5c-7885-42f1-87b5-7ba3d558d2a9\",\"name\":\"Mazher\",\"slug\":\"mazher\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/34db2e5c-7885-42f1-87b5-7ba3d558d2a9/oku4gs23\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/PqOVkGqWiX1eoURV6dWUEzluowqELdDmr01QRlSd8vp8.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/PqOVkGqWiX1eoURV6dWUEzluowqELdDmr01QRlSd8vp8/thumbnail.webp?time=3.317\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4:3\",\"duration\":20.526}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"01a00531-fd79-7155-a644-ced4f2e0ba30\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":6,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":7},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-15T11:32:36.865Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-15T11:32:36.865Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-15T11:32:36.860Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://www.youratlas.com/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"0539c25a-136d-4f8b-a2e7-342a21b7d607\",\"name\":\"AI\",\"slug\":\"ai\"},{\"id\":\"cb1ce5d0-8749-428e-b0d8-917786928ffd\",\"name\":\"Personal\",\"slug\":\"personal\"},{\"id\":\"1fec15c2-ca4a-4d52-bf3a-c04e6d002202\",\"name\":\"SaaS\",\"slug\":\"saas\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16619\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"KOG\",\"body\":\"$53\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"KOG AI — AI Coding Agents \u0026 Agentic Workflows\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"KOG AI is a modern AI SaaS landing page built to showcase the power of AI coding agents and autonomous workflows. The website combines bold visuals, clean layouts, and smooth interactions to communicate a highly technical product in a simple, engaging way. My focus was on creating a premium Framer experience that reflects innovation, builds credibility, and guides visitors toward taking action through a conversion-driven design.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Services Provided\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Framer Development\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Landing Page Development\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Responsive Development\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Custom Animations\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Performance Optimization\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Let's Build Your AI Product Website\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"WhatsApp:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"https://wa.me/923260558191?text=Hi%20Mazher!%20I%20just%20viewed%20your%20KOG%20AI%20project.%20I'm%20interested%20in%20building%20a%20modern%20AI%20website%20for%20my%20business.%20Can%20we%20discuss%20my%20project%3F\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"https://wa.me/923260558191?text=Hi%20Mazher!%20I%20just%20viewed%20your%20KOG%20AI%20project.%20I'm%20interested%20in%20building%20a%20modern%20AI%20website%20for%20my%20business.%20Can%20we%20discuss%20my%20project%3F\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"kog\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"34db2e5c-7885-42f1-87b5-7ba3d558d2a9\",\"name\":\"Mazher\",\"slug\":\"mazher\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/34db2e5c-7885-42f1-87b5-7ba3d558d2a9/oku4gs23\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/EyfHusphcuwA0093h3jRbURnGyVgEYS1P7T01IWUwrecI.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/EyfHusphcuwA0093h3jRbURnGyVgEYS1P7T01IWUwrecI/thumbnail.webp?time=5.55\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4:3\",\"duration\":17.609333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019f43ea-3633-740c-a588-e6deefd761b8\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":7,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":3},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-08T22:47:30.349Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-19T09:07:35.556Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-08T22:47:30.342Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://kog.ai/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"0539c25a-136d-4f8b-a2e7-342a21b7d607\",\"name\":\"AI\",\"slug\":\"ai\"},{\"id\":\"1fec15c2-ca4a-4d52-bf3a-c04e6d002202\",\"name\":\"SaaS\",\"slug\":\"saas\"},{\"id\":\"4e292c6b-a094-4031-be7b-7affa4349187\",\"name\":\"Agency\",\"slug\":\"agency\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16656\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Dirtverse\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eDirtverse is the digital home of Dirt — a global creative studio for sick start-ups, deeply invested founders and cool giants.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt in Framer, the experience blends editorial storytelling, immersive interactions and thoughtful motion to make every project feel like its own world.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Dirtverse is the digital home of Dirt — a global creative studio for sick start-ups, deeply invested founders and cool giants.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Built in Framer, the experience blends editorial storytelling, immersive interactions and thoughtful motion to make every project feel like its own world.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"dirtverse\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"e5579eaf-c864-425a-ab6d-8bf98b6c2a81\",\"name\":\"Dirt\",\"slug\":\"dirtverse\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/e5579eaf-c864-425a-ab6d-8bf98b6c2a81/d4fiwz64\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/eRXT7MUH6aKC7PGox01u3OSJrgU8Fbvr1a3kpIPRFF6w.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/eRXT7MUH6aKC7PGox01u3OSJrgU8Fbvr1a3kpIPRFF6w/thumbnail.webp?time=14.7\",\"aspectRatio\":\"67:54\",\"duration\":21.333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019f5aa8-ee8e-77bc-aec9-948ff4eb6614\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":48,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":1},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-13T08:47:28.075Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-14T07:27:05.349Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-13T08:47:28.072Z\",\"featuredAt\":\"2026-07-13T09:09:03.357Z\",\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://dirtverse.co/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"6a730e3d-bdf2-42a2-ab42-eee5ef39b694\",\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"},{\"id\":\"ddd39099-5b17-42e0-b333-7b7c480a114f\",\"name\":\"Business\",\"slug\":\"business\"},{\"id\":\"4e292c6b-a094-4031-be7b-7affa4349187\",\"name\":\"Agency\",\"slug\":\"agency\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16991\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Propellus\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003ePropellus, a publicly traded business funding company (OTC: PRPS), came to us with a template site that undersold everything about them. Generic stock imagery, dense walls of text, and a structure built for a single audience when in reality Propellus serves two: \u003cstrong\u003ebusinesses seeking fast capital, and accredited investors funding that growth. \u003c/strong\u003eNothing on the old site spoke to investors at all.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWe rebuilt the entire platform around that dual audience. Every page now splits the journey at the top - need capital, or want fixed returns, with dedicated paths for each: structured product pages for five funding solutions, an investment overview with clear terms, an investor relations hub for their OTC listing, press pages with CMS, and a custom video hero. The result is a site that works as hard for a $50K factoring deal as it does for an accredited investor reviewing a debenture offering.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Propellus, a publicly traded business funding company (OTC: PRPS), came to us with a template site that undersold everything about them. Generic stock imagery, dense walls of text, and a structure built for a single audience when in reality Propellus serves two: \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"businesses seeking fast capital, and accredited investors funding that growth. \",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Nothing on the old site spoke to investors at all.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"We rebuilt the entire platform around that dual audience. Every page now splits the journey at the top - need capital, or want fixed returns, with dedicated paths for each: structured product pages for five funding solutions, an investment overview with clear terms, an investor relations hub for their OTC listing, press pages with CMS, and a custom video hero. The result is a site that works as hard for a $50K factoring deal as it does for an accredited investor reviewing a debenture offering.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"propellus\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"e5ad8a34-97ae-4a3e-adc5-3be45c8b9b09\",\"name\":\"Wize\",\"slug\":\"wize\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/e5ad8a34-97ae-4a3e-adc5-3be45c8b9b09/29f1k05r\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/e5ad8a34-97ae-4a3e-adc5-3be45c8b9b09/01a01e4a-90b7-77e6-931b-b013bbfbe078.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(210 40% 16%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3925366084081248}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/e5ad8a34-97ae-4a3e-adc5-3be45c8b9b09/01a01e4a-9068-76fc-86c1-c75132ee1f0f.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(240 10% 16%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3925366084081248}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/e5ad8a34-97ae-4a3e-adc5-3be45c8b9b09/01a01e4a-90b6-752b-890f-91889c7a1074.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(240 75% 13%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3925366084081248}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/e5ad8a34-97ae-4a3e-adc5-3be45c8b9b09/01a01e4a-9069-77c8-b7a1-552ab2f27f01.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3925366084081248}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/e5ad8a34-97ae-4a3e-adc5-3be45c8b9b09/01a01e4a-90e2-767d-bdb0-8582aebf1631.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 36%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3925366084081248}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"01a01e4a-e1da-74e2-80aa-6afc464f2ddc\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"New client site just went live! Check it out.\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":7,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":4},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-20T08:30:17.101Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-20T08:30:17.101Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-20T08:30:17.092Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://propelluscorp.com/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"ddd39099-5b17-42e0-b333-7b7c480a114f\",\"name\":\"Business\",\"slug\":\"business\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16942\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Louismoss\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003ePortfolio of a Designer and Art Director\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Portfolio of a Designer and Art Director\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"louismoss\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"3f875a2c-30d8-4783-9332-afc195ccfcfe\",\"name\":\"Satto.studio\",\"slug\":\"sattostudio\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/35447/satto-3uRKG27Cusiw5TWmW7Gm1sQCYvr9HF.jpg\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/3f875a2c-30d8-4783-9332-afc195ccfcfe/01a004aa-08d7-7558-b247-bcdb117a38c1.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/3f875a2c-30d8-4783-9332-afc195ccfcfe/01a004aa-08eb-7687-bc49-8b2b8545fe01.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/3f875a2c-30d8-4783-9332-afc195ccfcfe/01a004aa-095f-7796-a914-a9eec4cf9594.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/3f875a2c-30d8-4783-9332-afc195ccfcfe/01a004aa-0946-74ee-8bf6-03f2b27973c6.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"01a004a8-edfa-701d-8cf8-87bf15028ab9\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":7,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":1},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-15T09:02:54.463Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-15T09:04:11.581Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-15T09:02:54.451Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://www.louismoss.com/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"6a730e3d-bdf2-42a2-ab42-eee5ef39b694\",\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"},{\"id\":\"cb1ce5d0-8749-428e-b0d8-917786928ffd\",\"name\":\"Personal\",\"slug\":\"personal\"}]}},{\"id\":\"17025\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Evolt\",\"body\":\"$54\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"A website for an engineering team working on serious fintech problems\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Evolt works with fintech companies on complex engineering projects, from payment infrastructure and crypto products to security and AI systems.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The challenge here was making all of that feel easy to understand without taking away from the technical credibility of the company.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The Challenge\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"There’s a lot behind what Evolt does.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"They work across infrastructure, payments, security, AI, and other parts of the fintech stack. The website needed to communicate that range, but I didn't want it to turn into a wall of services and technical terms.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The other important part was trust.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"When you're dealing with financial infrastructure, the website has to feel reliable from the first interaction.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The Design\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"I kept the visual direction fairly minimal and let the content do most of the work.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The homepage starts with a clear statement of what Evolt does, then gradually gets into their capabilities, technology stack, case studies, results, and the companies they work with.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"I also wanted the case studies to have a bigger role in the experience. Instead of just saying that Evolt can build complex fintech systems, the website shows the kind of work they've actually done.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The Result\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The final direction feels technical without being overly technical.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"It gives Evolt room to show the depth of their engineering work while keeping the website clean, confident, and easy to navigate.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The main idea was simple:\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Show the work. Keep the message clear. Let the engineering speak for itself.\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"evolt\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"ba95b34a-5ed3-496b-b8b2-e8c0a7412fcb\",\"name\":\"Krokzy\",\"slug\":\"krokzy\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/2057450/_LOuTwfoj-wwUSciBlcKRdMrpgbBhdqkjnCk5hnd\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/ba95b34a-5ed3-496b-b8b2-e8c0a7412fcb/01a029ea-a6be-72fb-8215-e7cc056c0345.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"01a029e0-3f61-75fd-b9cd-c38b20febb25\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"New website work for \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Evolt\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\".\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Evolt works on some pretty complex fintech and engineering projects, so the main challenge was making all of that easy to understand without making the website feel too technical.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Kept the design clean, focused on the work they’ve done, and gave the case studies more room to speak for themselves.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Sharing a few screens from the project.\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":4,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":1},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-22T14:29:16.704Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-22T14:40:44.389Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-22T14:29:16.701Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://evolt.dev/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"1fec15c2-ca4a-4d52-bf3a-c04e6d002202\",\"name\":\"SaaS\",\"slug\":\"saas\"},{\"id\":\"b65821c4-e205-4861-a28b-1623536037f7\",\"name\":\"Landing Page\",\"slug\":\"landing-page\"},{\"id\":\"4e292c6b-a094-4031-be7b-7affa4349187\",\"name\":\"Agency\",\"slug\":\"agency\"}]}},{\"id\":\"17062\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Flow Autobody\",\"body\":\"$55\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Flow Autobody\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" is a professional website I designed and developed for \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Flow Autobody\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\", a smash repair business based in Brisbane, Australia.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The goal was to create a clean, modern, and trustworthy online presence that clearly communicates their services while making it easy for potential customers to understand the repair process and get in touch.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"What I worked on\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Designed and developed the complete website in Framer\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Created 7 custom pages — Home, About, Services, Learning Centre, Contact, Service Detail, and 404\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Built CMS-powered Services with dynamic service detail pages\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Set up a CMS-powered Learning Centre with 14 articles\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Designed a sticky step-by-step repair process section\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Added smooth scroll animations and interactive elements\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Created animated logo ticker and testimonial sections\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Implemented responsive layouts across desktop, tablet, and mobile\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Set up SEO titles and descriptions across the website\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Built and connected the contact form\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Structured the CMS so the client can easily manage services and content\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The approach\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The design focuses on clarity, trust, and conversion rather than unnecessary visual complexity. The layout guides visitors through the business, services, repair process, and supporting content while keeping the primary actions easy to find.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The CMS setup was also an important part of the project, allowing the client to manage services and articles without needing to modify the website structure or rely on a developer for everyday content updates.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Built in Framer for Flow Autobody - Brisbane, Australia.\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"flow-autobody\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"b2944b49-57db-4e35-afe2-fd66490ade25\",\"name\":\"A.RAFAY\",\"slug\":\"arafay-top-rated-webdesignerdeveloper\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/299298/avatar-kVWlQlMVynBrpVZyFwMSWFbYsywRly.jpg\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/b2944b49-57db-4e35-afe2-fd66490ade25/01a042fc-24f1-7579-b7f7-9716ad16b811.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/b2944b49-57db-4e35-afe2-fd66490ade25/01a0360a-38bb-746b-8b49-60804ceca280.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(208 94% 25%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/b2944b49-57db-4e35-afe2-fd66490ade25/01a0360a-8dd4-7369-a615-75dda671ea84.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(208 94% 25%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/b2944b49-57db-4e35-afe2-fd66490ade25/01a0360a-9efb-773d-9a1e-2844f07858c1.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(208 94% 25%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"01a0360d-2643-75be-8d8b-422e15b3d814\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Launched a new digital experience for Flow Autobody - a smash repair business based in Brisbane, Australia.\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":5,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":2},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-24T23:13:45.971Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-27T11:30:53.088Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-24T23:13:45.968Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://flowautobody.com.au/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"ddd39099-5b17-42e0-b333-7b7c480a114f\",\"name\":\"Business\",\"slug\":\"business\"},{\"id\":\"4e292c6b-a094-4031-be7b-7affa4349187\",\"name\":\"Agency\",\"slug\":\"agency\"},{\"id\":\"cb1ce5d0-8749-428e-b0d8-917786928ffd\",\"name\":\"Personal\",\"slug\":\"personal\"}]}},{\"id\":\"10786\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"27b - Studio Portfolio\",\"body\":null,\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"27b-studio-portfolio\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"3c4607af-5447-44c9-bc20-95a2656b6e02\",\"name\":\"27b\",\"slug\":\"27b\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/412325/avatar-08gZyPNcQ2B2YKIwzHNhnY7QjDGY7E.jpg\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/sites/10786/thumbnail-zdWaFOScwZigRRYq2ZBAGmEqGqewJh.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 93% 22%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019b2d47-e245-71f2-a761-7c0dd66ad78e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":45,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":1},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2025-12-17T17:07:24.355Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-12-17T17:08:37.069Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-12-17T17:07:24.357Z\",\"featuredAt\":\"2026-06-16T11:41:51.307Z\",\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://27-b.com/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"6a730e3d-bdf2-42a2-ab42-eee5ef39b694\",\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16434\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"DIE ANTWOORD\",\"body\":\"\u003ch2\u003eDie Antwoord is a South African band by Ninja and Yo-Landi known for creating an iconic universe of music, film, and visual art.\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eOver the years, they\u0026#39;ve built a cult following for creating their own subculture ZEF STYLE.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWe created their new website built around their latest album and lore, ZAMA ZAMA. This thing needed to feel loud, dangerous, and full of easter eggs for their fans to find out!\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilding on Daytoner\u0026#39;s visions for the ZEF Taxi and the creative direction of Leri Greer, Ninja, and Yo-Landi was mad fun.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Die Antwoord is a South African band by Ninja and Yo-Landi known for creating an iconic universe of music, film, and visual art.\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Over the years, they've built a cult following for creating their own subculture ZEF STYLE.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"We created their new website built around their latest album and lore, ZAMA ZAMA. This thing needed to feel loud, dangerous, and full of easter eggs for their fans to find out!\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Building on Daytoner's visions for the ZEF Taxi and the creative direction of Leri Greer, Ninja, and Yo-Landi was mad fun.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"die-antwoord\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"dda8580a-1d0d-4569-b4db-8c82c9c9f45c\",\"name\":\"Kins Consultancy\",\"slug\":\"kins-agency\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/1730311/avatar-7fGpEOyLyPfyg6N5rM9am8glexUYeO.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/opMbLFBhrN0101bupmkWDaJrkvcPvhge0000Hxf02LAY6od8.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/opMbLFBhrN0101bupmkWDaJrkvcPvhge0000Hxf02LAY6od8/thumbnail.webp?time=51.383\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4:3\",\"duration\":59.583333}},{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/JjXSiw7Nc1q7aTPl00wO02f58BMhiFmlUyFkP9Soek3WI.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/JjXSiw7Nc1q7aTPl00wO02f58BMhiFmlUyFkP9Soek3WI/thumbnail.webp?time=1.65\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4:3\",\"duration\":17.55}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/dda8580a-1d0d-4569-b4db-8c82c9c9f45c/775eyrp6\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 9%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.7777777777777777}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019ee216-a2a8-7799-ab26-3b8318e8b54b\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Die Antwoord is a South African band by Ninja and Yo-Landi known for creating an iconic universe of music, film, and visual art.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Over the years, they've built a cult following for creating their own subculture ZEF STYLE.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"We created their new website built around their latest album and lore, ZAMA ZAMA. This thing needed to feel loud, dangerous, and full of easter eggs for their fans to find out!\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":137,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":4},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-06-19T22:53:14.745Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-06-19T23:02:27.754Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-06-19T22:53:14.742Z\",\"featuredAt\":\"2026-06-22T12:57:43.149Z\",\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://dieantwoord.com/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"6a730e3d-bdf2-42a2-ab42-eee5ef39b694\",\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"},{\"id\":\"cb1ce5d0-8749-428e-b0d8-917786928ffd\",\"name\":\"Personal\",\"slug\":\"personal\"},{\"id\":\"ddd39099-5b17-42e0-b333-7b7c480a114f\",\"name\":\"Business\",\"slug\":\"business\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16961\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"GrowthSync\",\"body\":\"$56\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"GrowthSync is an AI-powered social commerce platform\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"that helps brands turn comments, story replies, and DMs into product conversations, qualified leads, and revenue. The project involved taking my existing Framer template and customizing the design and experience specifically for GrowthSync's brand, product, and audience.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"I worked on adapting the template's visual system, layouts, content structure, interactions, and responsive experience to create a polished SaaS website that clearly communicates GrowthSync's value proposition while maintaining a premium, conversion-focused presentation.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Let's Create a Website That Converts:\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"calling\",\"emoji\":\"📲\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" WhatsApp: \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"https://wa.me/923260558191?text=Hi%20Mazher!%20I%20just%20viewed%20your%20GrowthSync%20project.%20I%E2%80%99m%20interested%20in%20creating%20a%20premium%20Framer%20website%20for%20my%20business.%20Can%20we%20discuss%20my%20project%3F\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"https://wa.me/923260558191?text=Hi%20Mazher!%20I%20just%20viewed%20your%20GrowthSync%20project.%20I%E2%80%99m%20interested%20in%20creating%20a%20premium%20Framer%20website%20for%20my%20business.%20Can%20we%20discuss%20my%20project%3F\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"growthsync\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"34db2e5c-7885-42f1-87b5-7ba3d558d2a9\",\"name\":\"Mazher\",\"slug\":\"mazher\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/34db2e5c-7885-42f1-87b5-7ba3d558d2a9/oku4gs23\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/9rHVi02xLnFIjtk2z00JC4d02VVMUSURjToytkQpXG02pZI.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/9rHVi02xLnFIjtk2z00JC4d02VVMUSURjToytkQpXG02pZI/thumbnail.webp?time=1.467\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4:3\",\"duration\":13.209333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"01a014bc-f6cc-72ba-90ba-22cf5fe76f13\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":7,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":5},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-18T11:58:42.908Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-18T12:01:13.092Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-18T11:58:42.901Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://www.growthsync.com/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"0539c25a-136d-4f8b-a2e7-342a21b7d607\",\"name\":\"AI\",\"slug\":\"ai\"},{\"id\":\"b65821c4-e205-4861-a28b-1623536037f7\",\"name\":\"Landing Page\",\"slug\":\"landing-page\"},{\"id\":\"1fec15c2-ca4a-4d52-bf3a-c04e6d002202\",\"name\":\"SaaS\",\"slug\":\"saas\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16935\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Let Me Explain\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eOfficial Companion to the Let Me Explain. \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLet me Explain is a YouTube channel dedicated to CFA Program candidates, that offers high-quality, comprehensive video tuition across all three exam levels since 2022.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://unikorns.agency/?utm_source=framer\u0026amp;utm_medium=refferal\u0026amp;utm_campaign=letmeexplain\u0026amp;utm_content=project_description\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003eUnikorns Agency\u003c/a\u003e took care of the complete rebranding, visual identity setup, website redesign, and the design of the YouTube channel as the core media channel.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Official Companion to the Let Me Explain. \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Let me Explain is a YouTube channel dedicated to CFA Program candidates, that offers high-quality, comprehensive video tuition across all three exam levels since 2022.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Unikorns Agency\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"href\":\"https://unikorns.agency/?utm_source=framer\u0026utm_medium=refferal\u0026utm_campaign=letmeexplain\u0026utm_content=project_description\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" took care of the complete rebranding, visual identity setup, website redesign, and the design of the YouTube channel as the core media channel.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"let-me-explain\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"76e99b28-8a77-4af2-aafb-f286740ef0ca\",\"name\":\"Unikorns\",\"slug\":\"unikorns\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/1455509/avatar-OAKzhtmweizcylbsDdDEuxZf6rvx5G.jpg\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/76e99b28-8a77-4af2-aafb-f286740ef0ca/01a000b8-41ea-76f9-874f-10ac7ee0dc1c.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(24 31% 25%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"01a000c1-0022-7486-8858-1464d4b9aee4\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The new look for \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Let Me Explain\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"href\":\"https://letmeexplain.eu/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" is finally live!\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Designed by \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Unikorns\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"href\":\"https://unikorns.agency/?utm_source=framer_profile\u0026utm_medium=post\u0026utm_campaign=letmeexplain\u0026utm_content=laun