text\":\"From AI startups and SaaS products to portfolios and creative agencies, ReadyToLaunch provides high-quality, launch-ready templates designed to make a strong first impression without starting from scratch.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"readytolaunch\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"dfcad505-1b3e-43ab-abae-6df6c89a064e\",\"name\":\"Green Yang\",\"slug\":\"green-yang\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/dfcad505-1b3e-43ab-abae-6df6c89a064e/n6bo54p7\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/dfcad505-1b3e-43ab-abae-6df6c89a064e/019feee2-bda0-7773-bb61-ef7c5494a100.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019feee3-d1f4-703a-ad10-7e2c4115b2e1\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Premium Framer templates built for startups, SaaS, and creators — designed to help you launch faster.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Now live at \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"go-readytolaunch.com\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"http://go-readytolaunch.com\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}},{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":17,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":2},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-11T03:35:35.178Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-11T03:35:35.178Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-11T03:35:35.171Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://go-readytolaunch.com/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"4e292c6b-a094-4031-be7b-7affa4349187\",\"name\":\"Agency\",\"slug\":\"agency\"},{\"id\":\"b65821c4-e205-4861-a28b-1623536037f7\",\"name\":\"Landing Page\",\"slug\":\"landing-pa