ext\",\"text\":\"A website that brings a brand's essence into a digital experience. \"},{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"herb\",\"emoji\":\"🌿\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Designed and built in Framer for Landscape architect João Paulo, combining minimal design, biophilic inspiration, and a seamless browsing experience to showcase the portfolio.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"landscape-architect\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"7af10058-58c2-449b-a87f-b183b2a8b787\",\"name\":\"STD Webster - Jakson Jr\",\"slug\":\"jakson-jr-alves\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/512385/avatar-TpqhhEfRN9TnkceSRzDXqXGQXlVsj9.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/7af10058-58c2-449b-a87f-b183b2a8b787/019f6d5c-57b1-73dc-96ad-98537b51553d.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019f6d5c-884e-737d-b71d-65bfa312714e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"A website that brings a brand's essence into a digital experience. \",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"herb\",\"emoji\":\"🌿\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Designed and built in Framer for João Paulo Paisagismo, combining minimal design, biophilic inspiration, and a seamless browsing experience to showcase the portfolio.\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":11,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":2},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-16T23:56:48.127Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-16T23:56:48.127Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-16T23:56:48.120Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://www.joaopaulopaisagismo.com.br/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"6a730e3d-bdf2-42a2-ab42-eee5ef39b694\",\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"},{\"id\":\"cb1ce5d0-8749-428e-b0d8-917786928ffd\",\"name\":\"Personal\",\"slug\":\"personal\"},{\"id\":\"b3738841-4fce-4e5d-af4b-034ff1decdba\",\"name\":\"Real Estate\",\"slug\":\"real-estate\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16545\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Twoplusone\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eWebsite portfolio for production agency Twoplusone. They believe in three things: ⑴ Familiar is forgettable. ⑵ Ordinary is overpriced. ⑶ Good things come in threes, not twos or fours.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Website portfolio for production agency Twoplusone. They believe in three things: ⑴ Familiar is forgettable. ⑵ Ordinary is overpriced. ⑶ Good things come in threes, not twos or fours.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"twoplusone\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"68264dd2-628d-4ead-9c3e-7db5dd3a7505\",\"name\":\"Sergio Past\",\"slug\":\"past-design\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/40839/avatar-5qIljX4Fo9VdnPOarEHiakuS7cdj8E.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/LQ7n6GaB02Gx7v8LQEo02TO00XhCjUz7pv5geXnfUJD8j00.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/LQ7n6GaB02Gx7v8LQEo02TO00XhCjUz7pv5geXnfUJD8j00/thumbnail.webp?time=17.349\",\"aspectRatio\":\"400:301\",\"duration\":37.670978}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019f1d32-71c1-771c-b603-398e02c737a3\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Recently wrapped a portfolio website for a production agency.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Bold visual direction, simple structure, and a strong focus on the work.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Designed and built in Framer.\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":31,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":1},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-01T10:21:12.971Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-01T10:21:12.971Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-01T10:21:12.962Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://twoplusone.co/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"6a730e3d-bdf2-42a2-ab42-eee5ef39b694\",\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"},{\"id\":\"ddd39099-5b17-42e0-b333-7b7c480a114f\",\"name\":\"Business\",\"slug\":\"business\"},{\"id\":\"4e292c6b-a094-4031-be7b-7affa4349187\",\"name\":\"Agency\",\"slug\":\"agency\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16823\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Sam Goraya\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eAn end-to-end website redesign for classical dancer \u003cstrong\u003eSam Goraya\u003c/strong\u003e, focused on presenting his work through a clean editorial experience. I designed the user journey, structured the information architecture, developed reusable CMS collections for events, workshops, publications, galleries, and videos, and built the entire website in Framer with responsive layouts and polished interactions.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"An end-to-end website redesign for classical dancer \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Sam Goraya\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\", focused on presenting his work through a clean editorial experience. I designed the user journey, structured the information architecture, developed reusable CMS collections for events, workshops, publications, galleries, and videos, and built the entire website in Framer with responsive layouts and polished interactions.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"sam-goraya\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"f303373e-d4a4-417b-8c24-ad29f5c127f2\",\"name\":\"Viswanathan M\",\"slug\":\"vizyack\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/587405/avatar-jympHw2Ik5z6nbnsCmGk1BAZTrMEth.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/f303373e-d4a4-417b-8c24-ad29f5c127f2/019fb1bc-b631-70cf-86d2-bc4a0ad25ddf.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(198 93% 22%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019fb1be-315c-742e-8277-ca36dca2c65e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Happy to showcase the Sam Goraya website in my portfolio. From UX and visual design to Framer development and CMS architecture, this project was built to celebrate an artist's journey through a clean and immersive digital experience.\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":13,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":2},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-30T06:37:39.061Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-30T06:37:39.061Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-30T06:37:39.052Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://www.samgoraya.com/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"6a730e3d-bdf2-42a2-ab42-eee5ef39b694\",\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"},{\"id\":\"cb1ce5d0-8749-428e-b0d8-917786928ffd\",\"name\":\"Personal\",\"slug\":\"personal\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16769\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"SandCastles\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eAI platform for creating viral short-form videos. Discover trending content, analyze top-performing creators, and generate engaging videos in seconds.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"AI platform for creating viral short-form videos. Discover trending content, analyze top-performing creators, and generate engaging videos in seconds.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"sandcastles\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"34db2e5c-7885-42f1-87b5-7ba3d558d2a9\",\"name\":\"Mazher\",\"slug\":\"mazher\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/34db2e5c-7885-42f1-87b5-7ba3d558d2a9/oku4gs23\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/sAhH01t007zB02kOhERAoe5GapJGGPupVYnvGORHWrTuac.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/sAhH01t007zB02kOhERAoe5GapJGGPupVYnvGORHWrTuac/thumbnail.webp?time=11.833\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4:3\",\"duration\":13.309333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019f9429-4406-74c4-916e-c4673d77672e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":7,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":3},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-24T12:45:59.858Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-24T12:45:59.858Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-24T12:45:59.853Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://www.sandcastles.ai/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"1fec15c2-ca4a-4d52-bf3a-c04e6d002202\",\"name\":\"SaaS\",\"slug\":\"saas\"},{\"id\":\"0539c25a-136d-4f8b-a2e7-342a21b7d607\",\"name\":\"AI\",\"slug\":\"ai\"},{\"id\":\"b65821c4-e205-4861-a28b-1623536037f7\",\"name\":\"Landing Page\",\"slug\":\"landing-page\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16990\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"The Pain Institute\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eA modern, conversion-focused healthcare experience for the Pain Institute of Southern Arizona. Designed to make complex pain care feel clear, human, and hopeful, the site pairs strong editorial typography with real patient stories, thoughtful motion, and a direct path from frustration to relief.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"A modern, conversion-focused healthcare experience for the Pain Institute of Southern Arizona. Designed to make complex pain care feel clear, human, and hopeful, the site pairs strong editorial typography with real patient stories, thoughtful motion, and a direct path from frustration to relief.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"the-pain-institute\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"284a6788-32de-4c5c-ae1e-dbce520404ec\",\"name\":\"Shawnee Wright\",\"slug\":\"shawnee-wright\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/1159017/avatar-wF7IXC1waagUGGGYTTdtr1g4BQB2lQ.jpg\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/qgXBjVjK9TATIA4CHTwQYRL01f02M02bDUeeTMjxFHzHtU.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/qgXBjVjK9TATIA4CHTwQYRL01f02M02bDUeeTMjxFHzHtU/thumbnail.webp?time=2.145\",\"aspectRatio\":\"800:601\",\"duration\":29.396044}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"01a01d27-59eb-708b-870e-bac346138c59\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Another one shipped \"},{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"zap\",\"emoji\":\"⚡\"}}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"A new landing page for PISA built around some seriously insane video content. Big visuals, strong motion, clean conversion flow, and a project that was just really fun to bring to life in Framer.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Very cool client. Very cool footage. Very cool project.\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":6,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":2},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-20T03:11:52.838Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-20T03:11:52.838Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-20T03:11:52.834Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://relief.pisapain.com/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"ddd39099-5b17-42e0-b333-7b7c480a114f\",\"name\":\"Business\",\"slug\":\"business\"},{\"id\":\"b65821c4-e205-4861-a28b-1623536037f7\",\"name\":\"Landing Page\",\"slug\":\"landing-page\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16986\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Rareform\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRareform — Concierge Health Platform\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA single landing page that positions premium healthcare as a performance system, designed and built in Framer in under two weeks.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Rareform — Concierge Health Platform\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"A single landing page that positions premium healthcare as a performance system, designed and built in Framer in under two weeks.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"rareform\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"fb0c6e50-a186-4e1a-a284-9ab6eb6cdfca\",\"name\":\"Anush N \",\"slug\":\"anush-foundrline\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/651586/avatar-RfI1SGkRdySkoNTaiGBezwTl6SjCmj.jpg\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/fb0c6e50-a186-4e1a-a284-9ab6eb6cdfca/01a01b4a-a277-7639-998f-ea246ca835e6.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(60 53% 39%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"01a01b4b-9d3b-71d8-b3b2-0e40c7a0b134\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Rareform — Concierge Health Platform\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"A single landing page that positions premium healthcare as a performance system, designed and built in Framer in under two weeks.\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":3,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":2},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-19T18:32:14.759Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-19T18:32:14.759Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-19T18:32:14.756Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://rareformhealth.co/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"0539c25a-136d-4f8b-a2e7-342a21b7d607\",\"name\":\"AI\",\"slug\":\"ai\"},{\"id\":\"b65821c4-e205-4861-a28b-1623536037f7\",\"name\":\"Landing Page\",\"slug\":\"landing-page\"},{\"id\":\"ddd39099-5b17-42e0-b333-7b7c480a114f\",\"name\":\"Business\",\"slug\":\"business\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16910\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Made In Paradise\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eAn immersive website for a Costa Rica creative competition, combining bold visuals, storytelling, and engaging content to attract creators, partners, and audiences.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"An immersive website for a Costa Rica creative competition, combining bold visuals, storytelling, and engaging content to attract creators, partners, and audiences.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"made-in-paradise\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"ffd35feb-89af-40bc-8591-18ebab260127\",\"name\":\"hellorizkieko\",\"slug\":\"hellorizkieko\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/29572/avatar-ljjFKEDTOj9FhzFjhXuAV81XjewlOn.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/cr1eGGJ4vwp99bhA7WIjl9OK00Xn9HWihZpMqTfFXeds.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/cr1eGGJ4vwp99bhA7WIjl9OK00Xn9HWihZpMqTfFXeds/thumbnail.webp?time=2.82\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4:3\",\"duration\":4.787889}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019fefb6-d365-71c6-8724-41a6090bbeb8\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":7,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":2},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-11T07:26:03.607Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-11T07:26:03.607Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-11T07:26:03.602Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://madeinparadise.co/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"d26c907e-7d56-4582-9727-b7c10921b71e\",\"name\":\"Community\",\"slug\":\"community\"},{\"id\":\"4256b748-1be0-4162-aa02-cb9346d9f63f\",\"name\":\"Travel\",\"slug\":\"travel\"},{\"id\":\"6a730e3d-bdf2-42a2-ab42-eee5ef39b694\",\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16993\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Argali Collection\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eARGALI Collection — Gallery Website\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eARGALI Collection is a contemporary art gallery, presenting painters and photographers whose work explores collective memory and cultural narrative. The gallery approached me to design and build a website that would let their artists and artworks speak for themselves.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe brief was deliberately restrained: a simple, editorial site that felt like an extension of the gallery\u0026#39;s identity rather than a conventional portfolio platform. The goal was to give each artist and each piece room to breathe — clean typography, generous whitespace, and a quiet visual rhythm that lets the work carry the page rather than compete with it.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe result is a straightforward, content-first site structured around the gallery\u0026#39;s artist roster and current exhibitions, built to be easy to navigate and easy for the gallery to keep updated as new work and shows come in.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"ARGALI Collection — Gallery Website\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"ARGALI Collection is a contemporary art gallery, presenting painters and photographers whose work explores collective memory and cultural narrative. The gallery approached me to design and build a website that would let their artists and artworks speak for themselves.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The brief was deliberately restrained: a simple, editorial site that felt like an extension of the gallery's identity rather than a conventional portfolio platform. The goal was to give each artist and each piece room to breathe — clean typography, generous whitespace, and a quiet visual rhythm that lets the work carry the page rather than compete with it.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The result is a straightforward, content-first site structured around the gallery's artist roster and current exhibitions, built to be easy to navigate and easy for the gallery to keep updated as new work and shows come in.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"argali-collection\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"4eecd5e7-5416-4cf5-9eb6-588ab72f30a1\",\"name\":\"Deub Studio\",\"slug\":\"deub-studio\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/1829963/avatar-dJz47kbdlvftzfUXGgKlo3sKVijF5K.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/4eecd5e7-5416-4cf5-9eb6-588ab72f30a1/01a01fdb-22df-70d8-97aa-8b898d365aa6.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(10 86% 22%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/4eecd5e7-5416-4cf5-9eb6-588ab72f30a1/01a01fdb-230b-7438-9431-28e91162dcdd.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(10 86% 22%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/4eecd5e7-5416-4cf5-9eb6-588ab72f30a1/01a01fdb-22f4-74db-b171-44ddc4316ecd.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(10 86% 22%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"01a01fdb-cd72-7659-a2da-5a477d7debc5\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"New creation\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":2,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":1},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-20T15:48:13.295Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-20T15:48:13.295Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-20T15:48:13.286Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://argalicollection.fr/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"6a730e3d-bdf2-42a2-ab42-eee5ef39b694\",\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"},{\"id\":\"b65821c4-e205-4861-a28b-1623536037f7\",\"name\":\"Landing Page\",\"slug\":\"landing-page\"}]}},{\"id\":\"12623\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"jemini.co/\",\"body\":null,\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"Jemini’s website is more than a digital presence, it’s a living expression of our identity. Each page unfolds with intent, using narrative, motion and interaction to demonstrate how change design can impact our humans and the organizations we partner with.\",\"slug\":\"jemini-co\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"fdb67361-c607-4c4c-b0e9-91c04b95ecfc\",\"name\":\"Laureen Feeny\",\"slug\":\"laureen-feeny\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/1719156/avatar-jMQe4wtzdEJKrXfEhZmwqz0H66Kiu6.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/sites/12623/thumbnail.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 53% 66%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/sites/12623/screenshotOne.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(260 94% 25%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/sites/12623/screenshotTwo.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 53% 66%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/sites/12623/screenshotThree.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(9 94% 28%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019c1075-e930-7d54-bedf-1c659e4ed55d\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":58,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":3},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-01-30T19:51:28.814Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-01-30T19:51:28.814Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-01-30T19:51:28.816Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://jemini.co/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"4e292c6b-a094-4031-be7b-7affa4349187\",\"name\":\"Agency\",\"slug\":\"agency\"},{\"id\":\"6a730e3d-bdf2-42a2-ab42-eee5ef39b694\",\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16616\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Entropik AI\",\"body\":\"$58\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Decode — Human Insights Platform\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Decode is an enterprise-grade Human Insights platform that empowers organizations to understand customer emotions, attention, and behavior, enabling teams to make smarter product, marketing, and business decisions. Built for large-scale enterprises, the platform transforms complex research into actionable insights through a modern, data-driven experience. I was responsible for developing the complete website in Framer, delivering a polished 10-page platform that balances sophisticated functionality with a clean, conversion-focused user experience.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Services Provided\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Framer Development\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Complete 10-Page Website\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Enterprise SaaS Development\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Responsive Development\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Custom Animations\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Interactive UI Development\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Performance Optimization\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Project Highlights\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Developed a complete 10-page enterprise SaaS website with a consistent and scalable design system.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Built product, solutions, feature, and marketing pages that clearly communicate a complex Human Insights platform.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Implemented smooth custom animations and micro-interactions to enhance engagement and elevate the user experience.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Created fully responsive layouts optimized for desktop, tablet, and mobile devices.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Structured content to present advanced analytics and research capabilities in a clear, intuitive, and visually engaging way.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Optimized the website for high performance, accessibility, and seamless navigation across all pages.\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Let's Build Your Enterprise SaaS Website\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Whether you're launching an AI platform, enterprise software, or a high-growth SaaS product, I build premium Framer websites that combine modern design, seamless interactions, and scalable user experiences that convert.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"calling\",\"emoji\":\"📲\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" WhatsApp:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"https://wa.me/923260558191?text=Hi%20Mazher!%20I%20just%20viewed%20your%20Decode%20project.%20I'm%20interested%20in%20building%20a%20premium%20enterprise%20SaaS%20website.%20Can%20we%20discuss%20my%20project%3F\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"https://wa.me/923260558191?text=Hi%20Mazher!%20I%20just%20viewed%20your%20Decode%20project.%20I'm%20interested%20in%20building%20a%20premium%20enterprise%20SaaS%20website.%20Can%20we%20discuss%20my%20project%3F\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}},{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"entropik-ai\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"34db2e5c-7885-42f1-87b5-7ba3d558d2a9\",\"name\":\"Mazher\",\"slug\":\"mazher\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/34db2e5c-7885-42f1-87b5-7ba3d558d2a9/oku4gs23\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/NAGKRzdZfLzNZ9U01sHK01NbJDUzqkD01PaEuRlRjWdFYY.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/NAGKRzdZfLzNZ9U01sHK01NbJDUzqkD01PaEuRlRjWdFYY/thumbnail.webp?time=1.9\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4:3\",\"duration\":23.409333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019f43dc-ed20-75f9-8447-2172d77a07f4\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":6,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":2},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-08T22:32:59.652Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-25T12:12:06.047Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-08T22:32:59.648Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://entropik.io/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"0539c25a-136d-4f8b-a2e7-342a21b7d607\",\"name\":\"AI\",\"slug\":\"ai\"},{\"id\":\"1fec15c2-ca4a-4d52-bf3a-c04e6d002202\",\"name\":\"SaaS\",\"slug\":\"saas\"},{\"id\":\"4e292c6b-a094-4031-be7b-7affa4349187\",\"name\":\"Agency\",\"slug\":\"agency\"}]}},{\"id\":\"3302\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Midlife Engineering\",\"body\":null,\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"A playful design site where ambient soundscapes and lo-fi visuals help you embrace your existential crisis. Built in Framer, inspired by Teenage Engineering, and made for mental health support.\",\"slug\":\"midlife-engineering\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"4d4d9333-ef11-4e84-9c52-2a026fb91e1f\",\"name\":\"Lee Black\",\"slug\":\"leeblack\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/72198/avatar-tITRI6fWrDA7ScuROCY5fJUlpsKNXj.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/sites/3302/thumbnail-tdfQGhzZQYOC0l82LOeltPkLxD4Eus.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 58%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"0195fc1c-60c3-795a-afb7-98cb58fb15c5\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":183,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":5},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2025-04-03T14:44:33.089Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-05-01T22:06:58.013Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-04-03T14:44:33.091Z\",\"featuredAt\":\"2026-06-16T10:00:07.654Z\",\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://www.midlife.engineering/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"cb1ce5d0-8749-428e-b0d8-917786928ffd\",\"name\":\"Personal\",\"slug\":\"personal\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16920\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"D5 Renovation Dubai\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eWebsite design \u0026amp; development · Framer · CMS · SEO · Analytics  \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eD5 is a Dubai-based design \u0026amp; build studio specializing in interior design, renovation, fit-out, technical supervision, and investor property flipping.  \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe goal was to reposition the company from a traditional renovation contractor into a premium full-cycle design \u0026amp; build studio, while rebuilding the website from the ground up in Framer.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Website design \u0026 development · Framer · CMS · SEO · Analytics  \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"D5 is a Dubai-based design \u0026 build studio specializing in interior design, renovation, fit-out, technical supervision, and investor property flipping.  \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The goal was to reposition the company from a traditional renovation contractor into a premium full-cycle design \u0026 build studio, while rebuilding the website from the ground up in Framer.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"d5-renovation-dubai\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"f33ed3b3-7dd6-4779-b570-bd71bac30374\",\"name\":\"Taras Kindrat\",\"slug\":\"taras-kindrat\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/f33ed3b3-7dd6-4779-b570-bd71bac30374/lwkdktkr\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/YH9X3LHnoccVNTkdUY2ihgZrmxfRUoNXRE5eZNNb8GU.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/YH9X3LHnoccVNTkdUY2ihgZrmxfRUoNXRE5eZNNb8GU/thumbnail.webp?time=11.2\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4:3\",\"duration\":13.666667}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/f33ed3b3-7dd6-4779-b570-bd71bac30374/01a0324a-cdf0-7449-ba5f-c2abcc4276c3.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 58%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019ff5f1-c2bf-7408-801f-7298edeb13c5\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"zap\",\"emoji\":\"⚡\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Another one shipped.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"This time for a Dubai-based design \u0026 build studio.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"D5 came to me with an existing website that needed more than just a visual refresh.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The goal was to make the business feel like what it actually is — a premium design \u0026 build studio — and build a website that could support that positioning.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"I handled the design, Framer development, CMS, localization, SEO, migration and analytics.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"One of the less visible parts was moving everything from Tilda to Framer without throwing away the existing SEO structure.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"18 redirects, custom GA4 tracking, WhatsApp conversion tracking, schema, and quite a few Framer-specific fixes later...\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"It's live.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"→ \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"d5renovationdubai.com\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"http://d5renovationdubai.com\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":11,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":1},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-12T12:28:09.144Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-24T05:43:24.847Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-12T12:28:09.136Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://d5renovationdubai.com/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"b3738841-4fce-4e5d-af4b-034ff1decdba\",\"name\":\"Real Estate\",\"slug\":\"real-estate\"},{\"id\":\"ddd39099-5b17-42e0-b333-7b7c480a114f\",\"name\":\"Business\",\"slug\":\"business\"}]}},{\"id\":\"12762\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"LUMENDA - Headhunting Agency\",\"body\":null,\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"This project showcases a modern landing page designed for a digital headhunting agency helping SMEs in the DACH region secure skilled talent.\",\"slug\":\"lumenda-headhunting-agency\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"c6d0aad4-c0dd-4029-861d-0cd6aaa6f3f4\",\"name\":\"Gustavo H. \",\"slug\":\"madebygustavoh\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/c6d0aad4-c0dd-4029-861d-0cd6aaa6f3f4/94zcb8k9\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/sites/12762/thumbnail-d344MdIxsd0kHGOjgPJrcD1KoDxmeO.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019c2423-47f1-7532-98f1-aef6cce19703\",\"bodyJson\":null,\