built in Framer. The first release explores a cursor-reactive neural interface, cinematic character composition and responsive experiences across desktop, tablet and mobile.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"An interactive science-fiction universe built in Framer. The first release explores a cursor-reactive neural interface, cinematic character composition and responsive experiences across desktop, tablet and mobile.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"skriksi\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"7a7cc215-a9a7-4e2c-8592-9e29987b354a\",\"name\":\"SKRIKSI\",\"slug\":\"skriksi\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/7a7cc215-a9a7-4e2c-8592-9e29987b354a/24echadh\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/48mpjJawKjZKf5IG7aPUjvLEdFlBx3N9vc00jD5X801xY.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/48mpjJawKjZKf5IG7aPUjvLEdFlBx3N9vc00jD5X801xY/thumbnail.webp?time=19.437\",\"aspectRatio\":\"367:208\",\"duration\":42.216667}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/7a7cc215-a9a7-4e2c-8592-9e29987b354a/019faa46-b1bb-7441-a478-be5b4f266063.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 22%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.5}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/7a7cc215-a9a7-4e2c-8592-9e29987b354a/019faa46-d18b-71dc-b27f-879c705ae4cd.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.1944869831546707}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019faa4c-0c8e-730b-aa62-079d65961907\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"he first interactive release of SKRIKSI is now live. A cinematic Framer experience featuring a cursor-reactive neural interface, custom motion and responsive compositions for desktop, tablet and mobile. Explore the live experience at \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"skriksi.com\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"http://skriksi.com\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":6,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":1},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-28T19:55:38.033Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-28T19:55:38.033Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-28T19:55:38.022Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://www.skriksi.com/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"6a730e3d-bdf2-42a2-ab42-eee5ef39b694\",\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"},{\"id\":\"0539c25a-136d-4f8b-a2e7-342a21b7d607\",\"name\":\"AI\",\"slug\":\"ai\"},{\"id\":\"ddd39099-5b17-42e0-b333-7b7c480a114f\",\"name\":\"Business\",\"slug\":\"business\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16988\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Senior Phone PDP\",\"body\":\"$59\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Senior Phone\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"ugc\",\"href\":\"https://seniorphone.co/orders\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Product Concept, Brand \u0026 Conversion Experience for a New Consumer Tech Category\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Snapshot\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Helped turn an unformed idea into a premium direct-to-consumer product concept, brand, and conversion-ready product experience.\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Client  \",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Senior Phone \",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"ugc\",\"href\":\"https://seniorphone.co/orders\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"(Early-stage consumer tech venture)\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Audience  \",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Seniors, Caregivers, Adult Children\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Scope  \",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Product Concept Strategy  Brand Design  Positioning \u0026 Copywriting  Product Narrative Architecture  Custom Visual Systems  Motion \u0026 Animation  PDP UX/UI Design  Web Development\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Timeline  \",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"~4–6 weeks\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Challenge  \",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Create an entirely new product concept and digital buying experience for a device category that didn’t yet exist in a compelling way.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Outcome  \",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Built the product concept, premium brand, and full-funnel PDP experience from scratch — turning an idea into a believable, purchasable system.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"senior-phone-pdp\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"fb0c6e50-a186-4e1a-a284-9ab6eb6cdfca\",\"name\":\"Anush N \",\"slug\":\"anush-foundrline\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/651586/avatar-RfI1SGkRdySkoNTaiGBezwTl6SjCmj.jpg\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/fb0c6e50-a186-4e1a-a284-9ab6eb6cdfca/01a01b52-4a48-72fa-a494-b920083c4a4b.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 58%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3377630121816169}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"01a01b59-cb59-77ca-be2a-fc457d544f5e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Sometimes a website project is really a product invention project.\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"For \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Senior Phone\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\", we turned an early-stage idea into a believable product category, premium brand, and conversion-ready buying experience framing it not as a “phone for seniors,” but as a communication and safety system designed for real life.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"More details on the project: \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Senior Phone Case Study Link\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"href\":\"https://www.foundrline.com/case-studies/building-trust-between-seniors-technology\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":2,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":1},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-19T18:47:44.001Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-19T18:47:44.001Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-19T18:47:43.998Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://seniorphone.co/orders/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"0539c25a-136d-4f8b-a2e7-342a21b7d607\",\"name\":\"AI\",\"slug\":\"ai\"},{\"id\":\"1fec15c2-ca4a-4d52-bf3a-c04e6d002202\",\"name\":\"SaaS\",\"slug\":\"saas\"},{\"id\":\"b65821c4-e205-4861-a28b-1623536037f7\",\"name\":\"Landing Page\",\"slug\":\"landing-page\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16118\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Jorn van Dijk\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eI refreshed my personal site with a \u003ca href=\\\"https://jornvandijk.com/notes\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nof