text\",\"text\":\"I updated my personal site a few weeks ago, so I can write the occasional note or share a video.\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":116,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":16},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-06-10T12:15:06.970Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-06-10T12:34:57.627Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-06-10T12:15:06.960Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://jornvandijk.com/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"cb1ce5d0-8749-428e-b0d8-917786928ffd\",\"name\":\"Personal\",\"slug\":\"personal\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16677\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Default Studio\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eDefault Studio is an independent design studio specializing in websites, branding, and digital product design for startups and ambitious businesses. Built entirely in Framer, our website showcases a clean visual language, thoughtful interactions, and a performance-first approach. Every page is designed to demonstrate how modern websites can be both visually engaging and highly functional.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Default Studio is an independent design studio specializing in websites, branding, and digital product design for startups and ambitious businesses. Built entirely in Framer, our website showcases a clean visual language, thoughtful interactions, and a performance-first approach. Every page is designed to demonstrate how modern websites can be both visually engaging and highly functional.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"default-studio\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"f1653712-e2e6-4ab9-9050-a9a1b42a2368\",\"name\":\"Isaac\",\"slug\":\"isaacdsign\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/1062214/avatar-ryAU8AXezyvKf4VaOfLGSiLRBUE6Zd.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/f1653712-e2e6-4ab9-9050-a9a1b42a2368/019f6521-3403-7562-bfb0-3cf1293d6f38.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.6}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019f6523-60bb-711f-8028-48e272aacbc3\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":23,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":2},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-15T09:37:24.786Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-15T09:37:24.786Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-15T09:37:24.780Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://default-studio.com/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"6a730e3d-bdf2-42a2-ab42-eee5ef39b694\",\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"},{\"id\":\"ddd39099-5b17-42e0-b333-7b7c480a114f\",\"name\":\"Business\",\"slug\":\"business\"},{\"id\":\"4e292c6b-a094-4031-be7b-7affa4349187\",\"name\":\"Agency\",\"slug\":\"agency\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16904\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Go-Getter\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eGo-Getter is a careers-tuition brand built in Framer for a specialist with 21 years across industry, universities, and schools. The site pairs a clean, credible brand identity with a full service and package structure, integrated Stripe checkout, testimonials, and a document-upload lead-capture flow - so it doesn\u0026#39;t just present the expertise, it runs the business. Fully responsive, with polished interactions throughout.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Go-Getter is a careers-tuition brand built in Framer for a specialist with 21 years across industry, universities, and schools. The site pairs a clean, credible brand identity with a full service and package structure, integrated Stripe checkout, testimonials, and a document-upload lead-capture flow - so it doesn't just present the expertise, it runs the business. Fully responsive, with polished interactions throughout.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"go-getter\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"09799978-a337-4c9c-a9e4-97f8cc233559\",\"name\":\"Shammas Anwer\",\"slug\":\"shammas-anwer\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/34990/avatar-8YKzPbZSVgp9f8fskuwHJ7fuvl9NLQ.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/09799978-a337-4c9c-a9e4-97f8cc233559/019fe7f6-9f6e-758d-bee3-32c1c8e34759.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 33%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019fe7f7-402f-72bf-8a3c-4d5bd94e7fad\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"New in my gallery: Go-Getter - a UK careers-tuition brand built in Framer. Structured packages, Stripe checkout, and a lead-capture flow - a site that runs the business, not just shows it. Take a look\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":7,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":2},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-09T19:19:28.168Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-09T19:19:28.168Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-09T19:19:28.161Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://go-getter.uk/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"ddd39099-5b17-42e0-b333-7b7c480a114f\",\"name\":\"Business\",\"slug\":\"business\"},{\"id\":\"4deaf317-a648-4f8b-ae2a-f9a4cf1a35da\",\"name\":\"Education\",\"slug\":\"education\"},{\"id\":\"b65821c4-e205-4861-a28b-1623536037f7\",\"name\":\"Landing Page\",\"slug\":\"landing-page\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16754\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"SubOne Studio\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eSubOne is a brand strategy studio helping creators and founders build brands designed to win in the attention economy.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"SubOne is a brand strategy studio helping creators and founders build brands designed to win in the attention economy.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"subone-studio\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"db7d2178-61de-4cd7-825f-f38940073e64\",\"name\":\"Guifré Serrano\",\"slug\":\"guifre-serrano\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/100435/avatar-gRVkfcsrgZ833RLTCTJFL1TT0wVbxc.jpg\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/db7d2178-61de-4cd7-825f-f38940073e64/019f8f67-31ca-708e-ab9d-7f1ccb762d44.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 86% 22%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019f8f67-4bdf-7340-9cff-544080a083b3\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"SubOne is a brand strategy studio helping creators and founders build brands designed to win in the attention economy.\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":14,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":4},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-23T14:35:38.926Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-23T14:35:38.926Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-23T14:35:38.910Z\",\"featuredAt\":\"2026-07-28T07:55:42.993Z\",\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://www.subone.studio/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"6a730e3d-bdf2-42a2-ab42-eee5ef39b694\",\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"},{\"id\":\"ddd39099-5b17-42e0-b333-7b7c480a114f\",\"name\":\"Business\",\"slug\":\"business\"},{\"id\":\"4e292c6b-a094-4031-be7b-7affa4349187\",\"name\":\"Agency\",\"slug\":\"agency\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16714\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Karol Ortyl\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eA portfolio of Karol Ortyl – fun-doing designer at large.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"A portfolio of Karol Ortyl – fun-doing designer at large.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"karol-ortyl\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"8f293bad-9a3f-4357-bc50-62766df86c27\",\"name\":\"Karol Ortyl\",\"slug\":\"karol-ortyl\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/8f293bad-9a3f-4357-bc50-62766df86c27/ekdbb1zz\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/NeRjhCb7HM5vLHMT6kszfsiMeKjHx5gbEg7w4sWQs5Q.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/NeRjhCb7HM5vLHMT6kszfsiMeKjHx5gbEg7w4sWQs5Q/thumbnail.webp?time=3.167\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4:3\",\"duration\":7.8}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019f7e73-1598-775c-af91-14cbdfa2db4f\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"point_down\",\"emoji\":\"👇\"}},{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"point_down\",\"emoji\":\"👇\"}},{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"point_down\",\"emoji\":\"👇\"}}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":21,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":3},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-20T07:34:58.886Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-23T11:19:54.145Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-20T07:34:58.874Z\",\"featuredAt\":\"2026-07-20T08:09:48.136Z\",\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://www.karolortyl.com/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"6a730e3d-bdf2-42a2-ab42-eee5ef39b694\",\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"}]}},{\"id\":\"17048\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Audit \u0026 Compliance\",\"body\":\"$5a\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"GWYNN CPAS\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"href\":\"https://www.gwynncpas.com/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" - Audit and Compliance Practice, Dallas TX\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"A lead-generation site for Gwynn CPAs, a Dallas audit firm led by Jon Gwynn — 20+ years in accounting and audit, starting at Arthur Andersen LLP, with leadership roles in private equity and energy audit firms.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The buyer arrives anxious: a lender demanded an audit, a deadline is close, penalties are on the table. So the site leads with the fear and answers it in the first line, then spends the rest of the page building trust through named clients and a transparent process.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Key sections:\"}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Hero addressing the actual worry — pass audits quickly, avoid penalties\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Three service cards with dedicated pages: Financial Statement Audits, Financial Reviews, Compilations\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Testimonial carousel with company logos and named executives — BODYBAR Pilates, StretchMed, FreeForm Chiropractic, Stronghold Investment Management, HUVRdata\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Credibility block: 20+ years, Arthur Andersen background, one-on-one commitment\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Six-step audit process — Get Aligned, Understand \u0026 Plan, Meet \u0026 Review, Risk Checks, Audit \u0026 Verify, Report \u0026 Support\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"\\\"Let's Talk\\\" kinetic marquee CTA band\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"CMS blog with author attribution, categories and read times\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Industries page for vertical targeting\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Free consultation booking as the single conversion action\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"What was built:\"}]},{\"type\":\"orderedList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Full design and Framer build, responsive across desktop, tablet and mobile\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"CMS collections for blog and service pages, client-editable\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Local SEO structure targeting Dallas audit and compliance queries, with service-level landing pages\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Trust architecture — logos, named testimonials, process transparency, credentials\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Single repeated conversion path: book a free consultation\"}]}]}],\"attrs\":{\"type\":null,\"start\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Stack: Framer, CMS, local SEO structure, GTM analytics\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"audit-compliance\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"968eff1d-454e-43fd-bed5-a47dac6d92cf\",\"name\":\"Pavlo Zhydkykh\",\"slug\":\"paulo-zhh\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/364632/avatar-Wss7Akqr96XCEmFiZdCcxsoKSx8sS0.jpg\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/968eff1d-454e-43fd-bed5-a47dac6d92cf/01a03403-4a49-7316-a940-971e6409258a.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/968eff1d-454e-43fd-bed5-a47dac6d92cf/01a03403-019f-73cf-af1b-97ce92d3be45.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/968eff1d-454e-43fd-bed5-a47dac6d92cf/01a03403-01a2-7589-a946-a7271a92fda5.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"01a03403-ac4e-731b-a8c3-d57a65e7aac0\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Built Gwynn CPAs — an audit firm in Dallas.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Professional services have a specific emotional starting point. Nobody wakes up wanting an audit; a lender demanded one and there's a deadline. So the hero names the fear directly instead of talking about \\\"excellence in accounting.\\\"\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Then the whole page is trust architecture: named clients with logos, a six-step process laid out plainly, 20 years of credentials. No mystery about what happens next.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Framer + CMS, service-level pages for local search.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"gwynncpas.com\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"href\":\"https://www.gwynncpas.com/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":7,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-24T13:44:10.512Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-24T13:44:10.512Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-24T13:44:10.508Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://www.gwynncpas.com/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"cb1ce5d0-8749-428e-b0d8-917786928ffd\",\"name\":\"Personal\",\"slug\":\"personal\"},{\"id\":\"ddd39099-5b17-42e0-b333-7b7c480a114f\",\"name\":\"Business\",\"slug\":\"business\"},{\"id\":\"d26c907e-7d56-4582-9727-b7c10921b71e\",\"name\":\"Community\",\"slug\":\"community\"}]}},{\"id\":\"13088\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Fundcycle Law - Lawyer Website\",\"body\":null,\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"Framer website for Fundcycle Law. A premium single-page solution for elite fund advisory in Asia. Designed as a sophisticated digital presence and information hub for fund managers.\",\"slug\":\"fundcycle-law-lawyer-website\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"92c2a437-4e58-4cd2-9a23-5fd81786f849\",\"name\":\"Webnity X\",\"slug\":\"webnity-x\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/92c2a437-4e58-4cd2-9a23-5fd81786f849/bcts2r71\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/sites/13088/thumbnail-PLNthQW6wBWjlfGNihwoCj9rp30gnJ.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019c538d-2e70-7b8a-a6f3-2f68a5102a58\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":36,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":3},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-02-12T20:31:27.340Z\",\"update