\"},{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"eyes\",\"emoji\":\"👀\"}}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"patex-in-progress\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"0834ae56-2be3-4d72-a07b-6ffa29aaf3bc\",\"name\":\"Ammar Yasir\",\"slug\":\"ammar-yasir-1bsb76\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/1131893/avatar-7SfRSgmEpHbZv5zy68gf6bEXvR5DXL.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/0834ae56-2be3-4d72-a07b-6ffa29aaf3bc/01a0168b-f228-7189-909d-dcd65cd1ff68.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(30 29% 55%)\",\"aspectRatio\":2.0146904512067154}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"01a0168c-3fc0-70b7-9393-0714c6d63f00\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Currently working on shipping this new project for \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Patex\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"It’s still a work in progress, so every creative eye is welcome! I’d love to hear your thoughts, critiques, and feedback on the design so far.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Hopefully, once this is wrapped up, I’ll also turn the concept into a new \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Framer Template\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" inspired by this design.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Would love to hear what you think! \"},{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"eyes\",\"emoji\":\"👀\"}}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":5,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":1},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-18T20:24:44.758Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-18T20:24:44.758Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-18T20:24:44.752Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://patex-new-sections.netlify.app/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"6a730e3d-bdf2-42a2-ab42-eee5ef39b694\",\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"},{\"id\":\"b65821c4-e205-4861-a28b-1623536037f7\",\"name\":\"Landing Page\",\"slug\":\"landing-page\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16662\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Lund Architects\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eA website for Lund Architects Atelier, showcasing thoughtful architecture, interior design, and a calm, timeless aesthetic.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"A website for Lund Architects Atelier, showcasing thoughtful architecture, interior design, and a calm, timeless aesthetic.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"lund-architects\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"8134d96e-6a7e-49d6-bdff-49a6b26ce6f1\",\"name\":\"Oliwia Mikołajczak\",\"slug\":\"oliwia-mikolajczak\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/420111/avatar-Sv2u6ydIeWo9sGGOpaqa2c7PnR3Sst.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/ljZVzDO02sD9lS01wdttGw3AINsTndrxn002AYIPpgGyR8.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/ljZVzDO02sD9lS01wdttGw3AINsTndrxn002AYIPpgGyR8/thumbnail.webp?time=2.86\",\"aspectRatio\":\"598:447\",\"duration\":16.900222}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/8134d96e-6a7e-49d6-bdff-49a6b26ce6f1/019f5ceb-66a5-74cb-a3c6-65218fc6e0b7.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(60 17% 51%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019f5cfc-64cc-74f6-8e0d-385ee5b1d55f\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"I had the pleasure of working with Lund Architects Atelier on the redesign and development of their new website. \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Their thoughtful approach to architecture and incredible attention to materials made this project a true pleasure to work on. I'm happy I could bring their vision to life \"},{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"sparkles\",\"emoji\":\"✨\"}}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":33,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":4},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-13T19:37:52.202Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-13T19:37:52.202Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-13T19:37:52.194Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://lundarchitects.com/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"6a730e3d-bdf2-42a2-ab42-eee5ef39b694\",\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"},{\"id\":\"ddd39099-5b17-42e0-b333-7b7c480a114f\",\"name\":\"Business\",\"slug\":\"business\"}]}},{\"id\":\"15220\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Seismografin\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eThis is what happens when storytelling and design work in perfect harmony in a collaborative effort. Would love to hear your feedback!\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"This is what happens when storytelling and design work in perfect harmony in a collaborative effort. Would love to hear your feedback!\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"A Swiss consultancy that strategically aligns development efforts with the true cultural drivers of an organization.\",\"slug\":\"seismografin\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"bf8a4431-e27b-4089-b7f8-0d83045c8d2d\",\"name\":\"NUWEBU\",\"slug\":\"nuwebu\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/bf8a4431-e27b-4089-b7f8-0d83045c8d2d/o6u9gxgn\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/V6EieDb5L02bOkm1fMJX3D6TW01bmDocEUgPgIFnHvk01U.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/V6EieDb5L02bOkm1fMJX3D6TW01bmDocEUgPgIFnHvk01U/thumbnail.webp?time=15.14\",\"aspectRatio\":\"558:425\",\"duration\":24.638589}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/sites/15220/thumbnail-XKm1NXRXplgJOhDKt7IwoFQoj2BKYk.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(8 89% 14%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019dedc9-2397-7319-bb6f-f67b6d8cbeb3\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Seismografin just crossed a big milestone in the featured gallery, and I’m honestly blown away by the response, thank you to everyone who’s checked it out and left a \"},{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"blue_heart\",\"emoji\":\"💙\"}}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"I’m considering turning it into a free template.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Please drop your ideas in the comments\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":80,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":8},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-05-03T12:21:15.286Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-03T10:40:32.382Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-05-03T12:21:15.287Z\",\"featuredAt\":\"2026-06-16T10:02:57.499Z\",\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://www.seismografin.ch/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"ddd39099-5b17-42e0-b333-7b7c480a114f\",\"name\":\"Business\",\"slug\":\"business\"},{\"id\":\"6a730e3d-bdf2-42a2-ab42-eee5ef39b694\",\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"},{\"id\":\"4e292c6b-a094-4031-be7b-7affa4349187\",\"name\":\"Agency\",\"slug\":\"agency\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16680\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Yaroslav Remastered\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eI\u0026#39;ve been heads-down rebuilding my portfolio for the past few weeks, and it\u0026#39;s finally live. New techniques, new scroll-driven animations, custom Framer components built from the ground up, a design language that finally matches the level of work I want to be known for. A lot of late nights getting the details right, but this is the first version I\u0026#39;m genuinely proud to put my name on. Would love to hear what you think.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"I've been heads-down rebuilding my portfolio for the past few weeks, and it's finally live. New techniques, new scroll-driven animations, custom Framer components built from the ground up, a design language that finally matches the level of work I want to be known for. A lot of late nights getting the details right, but this is the first version I'm genuinely proud to put my name on. Would love to hear what you think.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"yaroslav-remastered\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"55e66b8b-bd81-4efe-9f12-b81d28c78988\",\"name\":\"Yaroslav Cherevaty\",\"slug\":\"yaroslav-cherevaty\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/1448889/avatar-r3OcUBHK7vNpsK2jpsBm7bkjS9Ud3z.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/R79mmlAnr02Jeo01Gac01asR02Kh251T7hdjfoVX02KK3f00E.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/R79mmlAnr02Jeo01Gac01asR02Kh251T7hdjfoVX02KK3f00E/thumbnail.webp?time=17.633\",\"aspectRatio\":\"853:451\",\"duration\":38.283333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019f65f8-5e87-77ff-8d0c-8961316c00be\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"I've been heads-down rebuilding my portfolio for the past few weeks, and it's finally live. New techniques, new scroll-driven animations, custom Framer components built from the ground up, a design language that finally matches the level of work I want to be known for. A lot of late nights getting the details right, but this is the first version I'm genuinely proud to put my name on. Would love to hear what you think.\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":73,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-15T13:30:03.422Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-15T13:30:03.422Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-15T13:30:03.415Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://yaros.me/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"6a730e3d-bdf2-42a2-ab42-eee5ef39b694\",\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"},{\"id\":\"cb1ce5d0-8749-428e-b0d8-917786928ffd\",\"name\":\"Personal\",\"slug\":\"personal\"},{\"id\":\"b65821c4-e205-4861-a28b-1623536037f7\",\"name\":\"Landing Page\",\"slug\":\"landing-page\"}]}},{\"id\":\"16808\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"In Cahoots Studio\",\"body\":\"$5b\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"In Cahoots Studio\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"An award-winning storytelling studio working across film, strategy, and brand narratives.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"For this project, we built a premium cinematic single-page website entirely in Framer. We used the new Framer AI Agent to generate the initial wireframe and parts of the design system, giving us a strong starting point and significantly reducing setup time.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"From there, everything was carefully refined by hand, including typography, spacing, responsive behavior, interactions, accessibility, SEO, and performance.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The result is a fast, elegant, and highly polished experience that reflects the client's premium brand while demonstrating how AI can accelerate professional workflows without replacing thoughtful design.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Highlights\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Fullscreen cinematic hero video\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Interactive biography overlays\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Responsive across desktop, tablet, and mobile\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Optimized for performance, accessibility, and SEO\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Built entirely in Framer\"}]}]}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"in-cahoots-studio\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"92c2a437-4e58-4cd2-9a23-5fd81786f849\",\"name\":\"Webnity X\",\"slug\":\"webnity-x\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/92c2a437-4e58-4cd2-9a23-5fd81786f849/bcts2r71\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/92c2a437-4e58-4cd2-9a23-5fd81786f849/019fa9c8-3717-75f9-856a-98eab56b73b7.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 17%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019fa9c8-5899-7042-84d0-4ed0e378637e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":47,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-28T17:31:46.776Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-28T17:31:46.776Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-28T17:31:46.769Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"u