how to sound.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eturns out designing for others is easier. you have constraints, briefs, deadlines. designing for yourself is just you vs. every version of you.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eanyway, it\u0026#39;s live.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"http://nadtsonov.com\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003enadtsonov.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"spent 3 months rebuilding my own site.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"the hardest client i've ever worked with was myself. every decision felt like a fight — what to show, what to hide, how to price, how to sound.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"turns out designing for others is easier. you have constraints, briefs, deadlines. designing for yourself is just you vs. every version of you.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"anyway, it's live.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"nadtsonov.com\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"http://nadtsonov.com\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]}]},\"introduction\":\"\",\"slug\":\"nadtsonov-com\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"71657141-dde3-4fc5-9898-3d8ce0d637b0\",\"name\":\"Danil Nadtsonov\",\"slug\":\"dna\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/94546/avatar-LrGCCs5hZv20OwkU7kltaeoV3lxdPK.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/5GXcEB3y02GgmFq02TTz51Kq9ouLTBI3lo2QxrDTZyBLA.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/5GXcEB3y02GgmFq02TTz51Kq9ouLTBI3lo2QxrDTZyBLA/thumbnail.webp?time=14.017\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4:3\",\"duration\":36.727333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019fe0ad-03f1-733c-a86d-03237e4e5e35\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"spent 3 months rebuilding my own site.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"the hardest client i've ever worked with was myself. every decision felt like a fight — what to show, what to hide, how to price, how to sound.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"turns out designing for others is easier. you have constraints, briefs, deadlines. designing for yourself is just you vs. every version of you.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"anyway, it's live.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"nadtsonov.com\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"http://nadtsonov.com\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":6,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":2},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-08T09:21:02.481Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-08T09:21:02.481Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-08T09:21:02.476Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"site\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://nadtsonov.com/\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"6a730e3d-bdf2-42a2-ab42-eee5ef39b694\",\"name\":\"Portfolio\",\"slug\":\"portfolio\"},{\"id\":\"cb1ce5d0-8749-428e-b0d8-917786928ffd\",\"name\":\"Personal\",\"slug\":\"personal\"},{\"id\":\"b65821c4-e205-4861-a28b-1623536037f7\",\"name\":\"Landing Page\",\"slug\":\"landing-page\"}]}},{\"id\":\"10273\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Composio\",\"body\":null,\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"We built this interactive website for Composio, an AI startup based in SF. This was announced alongside their $24M Series A fundraise.\",\"slug\":\"composio\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"9a9bb58b-a660-4135-aeb4-253de7c58334\",\"name\":\"Abhinav Chhikara\",\"slug\":\"a